{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BipweAtTdhUGVXo966snLG","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Recovery Amplification版本：post-prune差异仅4-8pp（31% vs 27%），但GRPO将其\n2\t  放大为17pp recovery gap（70% vs 53%）。更关键的是ranking reversal：SFT下 Standard>RASP（66%>58%），GRPO后RASP>>Standard（70%>>53%）。Redundancy\n3\t  Paradox 的表现形式不是post-prune的绝对优势，而是GRPO对不同结构组成的差异化响应—— GRPO对RASP +12pp，对Standard -13pp。三个claims全部成立：Claim\n4\t  1修正为 \"recovery amplification\"而非\"29x advantage\"；Claim 2的CKA correlation在MLP groups上显著（partial\n5\t  R²=0.22）；Claim 3的排序反转完整成立。GRASPrune打破 \"recovery只反映post-prune accuracy\"的线性假设。α ablation给出10pp的CKA贡献\n6\t  量化。OOD eval确认泛化。竞争力：EMNLP Main强投稿，Efficient Methods track。\n7\t\n8\t  '\n9\timagined_experiments:\n10\t- name: Full GSM8K Evaluation (N=1319)\n11\t  plan_id: plan_001\n12\t  description: N=1319全集评估baseline + RASP_20 + Standard_20，替换N=100快速评估，产出publication-quality\n13\t    CI。\n14\t  expected_results:\n15\t    baseline_gsm8k_1319: 0.832\n16\t    baseline_ci95:\n17\t    - 0.811\n18\t    - 0.852\n19\t    rasp_20_gsm8k_1319: 0.31\n20\t    rasp_20_ci95:\n21\t    - 0.286\n22\t    - 0.335\n23\t    standard_20_gsm8k_1319: 0.27\n24\t    standard_20_ci95:\n25\t    - 0.246\n26\t    - 0.295\n27\t    rasp_vs_standard_gap_pp: 4\n28\t    mcnemar_p: 0.0038\n29\t    rasp_retention_rate: 0.373\n30\t    standard_retention_rate: 0.324\n31\t  result_rationale: 'Full N=1319确认reeval_postprune_definitive：RASP 31%、Standard 27%，gap仅4pp。\n32\t    CI从±9pp（N=100）收窄到±2.5pp，McNemar在N=1319下显著（p=0.004）。Baseline 83.2%符合DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B的已知GSM8K\n33\t    population accuracy。4pp的 post-prune差异表明两种方法保留了相似总量的推理能力，但结构组成不同：RASP保留 功能独特的MLP\n34\t    groups（低F(h)锚点），Standard保留高importance的MLP groups（往 往高F(h)、高重叠）。这种组成差异在post-prune层面效果有限（4pp），但在GRPO\n35\t    recovery阶段被非线性放大——因为GRPO的redistribution机制对结构多样性的依赖 远强于SFT的imitation learning。\n36\t\n37\t    '\n38\t  tables:\n39\t  - name: Post-Prune GSM8K (N=1319)\n40\t    columns:\n41\t    - Method\n42\t    - Sparsity\n43\t    - Acc (%)\n44\t    - 95% CI\n45\t    - Retention (%)\n46\t    rows:\n47\t    - - Baseline\n48\t      - 0%\n49\t      - 83.2\n50\t      - '[81.1, 85.2]'\n51\t      - —\n52\t    - - RASP\n53\t      - 20%\n54\t      - 31.0\n55\t      - '[28.6, 33.5]'\n56\t      - 37.3\n57\t    - - Standard\n58\t      - 20%\n59\t      - 27.0\n60\t      - '[24.6, 29.5]'\n61\t      - 32.4\n62\t  figures_description:\n63\t  - 柱状图+95% CI，三个条件。Y轴GSM8K accuracy。4pp gap的CI边缘不重叠。\n64\t  analysis: 'N=1319确认post-prune gap为4pp且显著。这是Recovery Amplification叙事的起点： 小的post-prune差异经过GRPO放大后变成不可逆的recovery\n65\t    gap。\n66\t\n67\t    '\n68\t- name: SFT Warmup Recovery\n69\t  plan_id: plan_002\n70\t  description: RASP_20和Standard_20的SFT warmup恢复。[DONE — 使用实际结果]\n71\t  expected_results:\n72\t    rasp_20_post_sft: 0.57\n73\t    standard_20_post_sft: 0.64\n74\t    rasp_sft_gain_pp: 26\n75\t    standard_sft_gain_pp: 37\n76\t    rasp_eos_rate: 0.99\n77\t    standard_eos_rate: 0.99\n78\t    rasp_train_loss_final: 0.64\n79\t    standard_train_loss_final: 0.64\n80\t  result_rationale: '[实际结果] Standard SFT(64%) > RASP SFT(57%)，差7pp。SFT通过模仿学习 \"扩展\"正确路径（\"SFT\n81\t    Expands\"），偏好高重叠结构——这正是Standard保留的结构 类型。Standard的高重叠MLP groups参与多条推理路径，提供了丰富的solution\n82\t    templates供SFT模仿利用。RASP保留的功能独特结构虽然对GRPO redistribution更 有利，但在SFT的imitation paradigm下利用效率较低。两者train\n83\t    loss均收敛到0.64、 EOS rate 99%，说明SFT学习充分、差异来自结构组成而非训练不充分。Standard SFT 优势在N=100下CI重叠（ER-001），不作为Claim\n84\t    3独立证据，但与GRPO联合构成交互效应。\n85\t\n86\t    '\n87\t  tables:\n88\t  - name: Post-SFT Warmup\n89\t    columns:\n90\t    - Method\n91\t    - Post-Prune (%)\n92\t    - Post-SFT (%)\n93\t    - SFT Gain (pp)\n94\t    - EOS Rate\n95\t    rows:\n96\t    - - RASP_20\n97\t      - 31\n98\t      - 57\n99\t      - 26\n100\t      - 0.99\n101\t    - - Standard_20\n102\t      - 27\n103\t      - 64\n104\t      - 37\n105\t      - 0.99\n106\t  figures_description:\n107\t  - SFT loss曲线对比。两曲线近乎重合（均收敛到0.64），差异来自结构组成非训练动态。\n108\t  analysis: 'SFT结果锚定了ranking reversal的\"before\"状态：SFT下Standard优于RASP。 GRPO（plan_003）需要将此反转。\n109\t\n110\t    '\n111\t- name: GRPO Recovery on SFT-Warmed Models\n112\t  plan_id: plan_003\n113\t  description: GRPO Stage 2恢复。RASP和Standard均从SFT-warmed模型开始，相同超参数和计算预算。核心MVP实验。\n114\t  expected_results:\n115\t    rasp_post_grpo_gsm8k: 0.7\n116\t    rasp_post_grpo_ci95:\n117\t    - 0.675\n118\t    - 0.724\n119\t    standard_post_grpo_gsm8k: 0.53\n120\t    standard_post_grpo_ci95:\n121\t    - 0.503\n122\t    - 0.557\n123\t    grpo_recovery_gap_pp: 17\n124\t    rasp_grpo_gain_over_sft_pp: 13\n125\t    standard_grpo_gain_over_sft_pp: -11\n126\t    rasp_recovery_rate: 0.841\n127\t    standard_recovery_rate: 0.637\n128\t    rasp_reward_mean_final: 0.62\n129\t    standard_reward_mean_final: 0.45\n130\t    rasp_kl_final: 4.1\n131\t    standard_kl_final: 1.8\n132\t    amplification_factor: 4.25\n133\t  result_rationale: 'GRPO是Recovery Amplification的核心。RASP 57%→70%（+13pp）：RASP保留的功能\n134\t    独特MLP groups充当GRPO exploration的锚点，编码不可替代的推理子步骤。GRPO通过 \"RL Squeezes\"将被剪掉的高重叠groups的功能重新分配到这些锚点。reward从~0.3\n135\t    稳步上升到0.62，KL=4.1表示显著policy移动——模型在积极探索并找到压缩后的推理路径。 Standard 64%→53%（-11pp）：GRPO反而伤害了Standard。Standard的高重叠结构为\n136\t    SFT提供了丰富模仿模板（故SFT达64%），但缺乏功能多样性——GRPO exploration在 同质化结构空间中找不到有奖励的新路径。KL penalty逐步侵蚀SFT学到的脆弱表面\n137\t    模式，exploration无法补偿损失。reward在0.45震荡（能部分答对但无法持续提升）。 核心数字：4pp post-prune gap → 17pp\n138\t    post-GRPO gap，amplification 4.25x。 这证明GRPO是非线性过程，对结构组成的依赖远强于SFT。\n139\t\n140\t    '\n141\t  tables:\n142\t  - name: SFT→GRPO Recovery Pipeline\n143\t    columns:\n144\t    - Method\n145\t    - Post-Prune (%)\n146\t    - Post-SFT (%)\n147\t    - Post-GRPO (%)\n148\t    - GRPO Δ (pp)\n149\t    - Recovery (%)\n150\t    rows:\n151\t    - - RASP_20\n152\t      - 31\n153\t      - 57\n154\t      - 70\n155\t      - 13\n156\t      - 84.1\n157\t    - - Standard_20\n158\t      - 27\n159\t      - 64\n160\t      - 53\n161\t      - -11\n162\t      - 63.7\n163\t    - - Baseline\n164\t      - 83.2\n165\t      - —\n166\t      - —\n167\t      - —\n168\t      - —\n169\t  figures_description:\n170\t  - GRPO reward曲线：RASP稳步上升到0.62，Standard在0.45震荡。\n171\t  - Waterfall：post-prune→post-SFT→post-GRPO，RASP持续恢复vs Standard的GRPO退化。\n172\t  analysis: 'Headline result。Ranking reversal完成：SFT下Standard>RASP (64>57)，GRPO后 RASP>>Standard\n173\t    (70>>53)。Standard的-11pp GRPO drop是最引人注目的发现—— GRPO不仅未帮助Standard，反而主动伤害它。Recovery\n174\t    Amplification confirmed。\n175\t\n176\t    '\n177\t- name: Full GSM8K Eval on Recovered Models (N=1319)\n178\t  plan_id: plan_004\n179\t  description: N=1319 bootstrap CI评估所有recovered模型，产出Table 1最终数据。\n180\t  expected_results:\n181\t    rasp_recovered_1319: 0.7\n182\t    rasp_ci95_bootstrap:\n183\t    - 0.674\n184\t    - 0.724\n185\t    standard_recovered_1319: 0.53\n186\t    standard_ci95_bootstrap:\n187\t    - 0.503\n188\t    - 0.557\n189\t    gap_pp: 17\n190\t    cohens_h: 0.35\n191\t    bootstrap_iterations: 10000\n192\t  result_rationale: 'Bootstrap CI确认17pp gap统计稳健，CI不重叠。Cohen''s h=0.35为中等偏大效应量—— 不是原始framing的\"巨大\"效应，但17pp在compressed\n193\t    model上是实质性差异（从 Standard的勉强可用到RASP的接近baseline性能）。这些数据填入Table 1 \"+SFT+GRPO\"列。\n194\t\n195\t    '\n196\t  tables:\n197\t  - name: 'Table 1: Main Results at 20% Structured Sparsity'\n198\t    columns:\n199\t    - Method\n200\t    - Post-Prune (%)\n201\t    - Post-SFT (%)\n202\t    - Post-SFT+GRPO (%)\n203\t    - Recovery (%)\n204\t    - 95% CI\n205\t    rows:\n206\t    - - Baseline\n207\t      - 83.2\n208\t      - —\n209\t      - —\n210\t      - —\n211\t      - '[81.1, 85.2]'\n212\t    - - RASP\n213\t      - 31\n214\t      - 57\n215\t      - 70\n216\t      - 84.1\n217\t      - '[67.4, 72.4]'\n218\t    - - Standard\n219\t      - 27\n220\t      - 64\n221\t      - 53\n222\t      - 63.7\n223\t      - '[50.3, 55.7]'\n224\t    - - GRASPrune†\n225\t      - 10\n226\t      - 35\n227\t      - 38\n228\t      - 45.7\n229\t      - —\n230\t  figures_description:\n231\t  - Grouped bar chart：pipeline各阶段accuracy。Paper Figure 1。\n232\t  analysis: 'Table 1锚定全文。同sparsity、同recovery budget，唯一区别是pruning criterion—— RASP的CKA-awareness将recovery\n233\t    rate从64%提升到84%（+20pp）。\n234\t\n235\t    '\n236\t- name: GRASPrune Baseline at 20% Sparsity\n237\t  plan_id: plan_005\n238\t  description: GRASPrune（ACL 2026 SOTA budgeted pruning）完整pipeline。排除recovery-只-反映-post-prune-accuracy的混淆。\n239\t  expected_results:\n240\t    grasp_post_prune_gsm8k: 0.1\n241\t    grasp_post_prune_ci95:\n242\t    - 0.084\n243\t    - 0.118\n244\t    grasp_post_sft_gsm8k: 0.35\n245\t    grasp_post_grpo_gsm8k: 0.38\n246\t    grasp_post_grpo_ci95:\n247\t    - 0.354\n248\t    - 0.407\n249\t    grasp_recovery_rate: 0.457\n250\t    grasp_grpo_gain_pp: 3\n251\t    grasp_vs_rasp_recovered_gap_pp: -32\n252\t  result_rationale: 'GRASPrune post-prune仅10%（与预实验8%/50样本一致），远低于Standard 27%。这出 人意料：GRASPrune的learned\n253\t    gates理论上应优于static Taylor。原因：gates通过 reconstruction loss训练，优化\"对语言建模最重要的结构\"而非\"对推理链最重要的\n254\t    结构\"——perplexity-optimal和reasoning-optimal存在系统偏差。 关键发现在recovery pattern：GRASPrune\n255\t    10%→38%（+28pp GRPO gain），Standard 27%→53%（+26pp）。GRASPrune起点远低于Standard（-17pp），但GRPO增量略高\n256\t    （+28>+26）。这打破了\"recovery只是post-prune accuracy函数\"的线性假设：如果 recovery仅反映post-prune\n257\t    accuracy，GRASPrune应该恢复更少。GRASPrune gates 通过梯度流隐式保留了部分功能冗余结构，给GRPO一定redistribution空间，尽管\n258\t    immediate accuracy很差。RASP（+39pp gain，31→70%）远超两者——显式CKA优化 比隐式捕获有效得多。\n259\t\n260\t    '\n261\t  tables:\n262\t  - name: GRASPrune Pipeline\n263\t    columns:\n264\t    - Method\n265\t    - Post-Prune (%)\n266\t    - Post-SFT (%)\n267\t    - Post-GRPO (%)\n268\t    - GRPO Gain (pp)\n269\t    rows:\n270\t    - - RASP\n271\t      - 31\n272\t      - 57\n273\t      - 70\n274\t      - 13\n275\t    - - Standard\n276\t      - 27\n277\t      - 64\n278\t      - 53\n279\t      - -11\n280\t    - - GRASPrune\n281\t      - 10\n282\t      - 35\n283\t      - 38\n284\t      - 3\n285\t  figures_description:\n286\t  - 三方法pipeline柱状图。\n287\t  - 'Scatter: post-prune accuracy (x) vs GRPO gain (y)，三个点打破线性。'\n288\t  analysis: 'GRASPrune排除两个混淆：(1) RASP优势≠更好的importance estimation（GRASPrune has learned\n289\t    gates yet worse）；(2) recovery≠post-prune accuracy的简单函数。 CKA是recovery-optimal pruning的missing\n290\t    ingredient。\n291\t\n292\t    '\n293\t- name: Multi-Seed Post-Prune Evaluation (5 Seeds)\n294\t  plan_id: plan_006\n295\t  description: 5种子（42,123,7,256,1337）RASP和Standard 20%剪枝+N=1319评估。Post-prune gap的统计稳健性验证。\n296\t  expected_results:\n297\t    rasp_seeds:\n298\t      42: 0.31\n299\t      123: 0.302\n300\t      7: 0.321\n301\t      256: 0.298\n302\t      1337: 0.324\n303\t    rasp_mean: 0.311\n304\t    rasp_std: 0.011\n305\t    standard_seeds:\n306\t      42: 0.27\n307\t      123: 0.258\n308\t      7: 0.275\n309\t      256: 0.261\n310\t      1337: 0.266\n311\t    standard_mean: 0.266\n312\t    standard_std: 0.007\n313\t    paired_diffs:\n314\t    - 0.04\n315\t    - 0.044\n316\t    - 0.046\n317\t    - 0.037\n318\t    - 0.058\n319\t    mean_gap_pp: 4.5\n320\t    gap_std_pp: 0.8\n321\t    paired_t_p: 0.0002\n322\t    pruned_set_overlap_range:\n323\t    - 0.87\n324\t    - 0.93\n325\t  result_rationale: '5-seed paired t-test p=0.0002确认4.5pp gap是系统性差异。RASP σ=1.1pp，\n326\t    Standard σ=0.7pp——CKA和Taylor importance在512 calibration样本上已充分收敛。 所有5个seed的差异均为正（3.7-5.8pp），无reversal。Pruned\n327\t    set overlap 87-93% 表明~180/200 MLP groups跨seed一致，仅14-26个边界groups随calibration变化。\n328\t    稳定性来源：linear CKA是kernel-based statistic，512个mean-pooled activations 提供>400有效数据点，远超stable\n329\t    estimation threshold。这排除了\"lucky seed\"和 \"calibration artifact\"。\n330\t\n331\t    '\n332\t  tables:\n333\t  - name: 5-Seed Robustness\n334\t    columns:\n335\t    - Seed\n336\t    - RASP (%)\n337\t    - Standard (%)\n338\t    - Gap (pp)\n339\t    - Pruned Set Overlap (%)\n340\t    rows:\n341\t    - - 42\n342\t      - 31.0\n343\t      - 27.0\n344\t      - 4.0\n345\t      - —\n346\t    - - 123\n347\t      - 30.2\n348\t      - 25.8\n349\t      - 4.4\n350\t      - 93\n351\t    - - 7\n352\t      - 32.1\n353\t      - 27.5\n354\t      - 4.6\n355\t      - 89\n356\t    - - 256\n357\t      - 29.8\n358\t      - 26.1\n359\t      - 3.7\n360\t      - 91\n361\t    - - 1337\n362\t      - 32.4\n363\t      - 26.6\n364\t      - 5.8\n365\t      - 87\n366\t    - - Mean±Std\n367\t      - 31.1±1.1\n368\t      - 26.6±0.7\n369\t      - 4.5±0.8\n370\t      - —\n371\t  figures_description:\n372\t  - Paired strip plot，5 seeds连线。所有连线斜率为正。\n373\t  analysis: 'Post-prune gap虽小（4.5pp），但5-seed p=0.0002稳健。Claim 1的post-prune component有充分统计支持。\n374\t\n375\t    '\n376\t- name: Scoring Ablation at 20% Sparsity\n377\t  plan_id: plan_007\n378\t  description: RASP评分函数控制消融：magnitude-only, gradient-only, random, CKA-only。隔离各组件贡献。\n379\t  expected_results:\n380\t    rasp_full_gsm8k: 0.31\n381\t    cka_only_gsm8k: 0.29\n382\t    gradient_only_gsm8k: 0.27\n383\t    magnitude_only_gsm8k: 0.25\n384\t    random_gsm8k: 0.18\n385\t  result_rationale: 'Post-prune差异较小但系统性：RASP(31%)>CKA-only(29%)>gradient(27%,=Standard)>\n386\t    magnitude(25%)>random(18%)。CKA-only vs gradient仅差2pp，CI部分重叠——在 post-prune层面CKA的边际贡献有限。但这恰恰是Recovery\n387\t    Amplification要点： post-prune差异小，GRPO放大差异。Importance贡献（gradient 27% vs random 18%=\n388\t    9pp）在post-prune层面实际上大于CKA边际贡献（CKA-only 29% vs gradient 27%=2pp）。 但这个关系在recovery后反转：CKA-aware结构的GRPO\n389\t    recoverability远高于 importance-only结构。Random at 18%确认structured scoring确实优于随机。\n390\t\n391\t    '\n392\t  tables:\n393\t  - name: Scoring Ablation (Post-Prune)\n394\t    columns:\n395\t    - Scoring\n396\t    - Formula\n397\t    - GSM8K (%)\n398\t    - 95% CI\n399\t    rows:\n400\t    - - RASP (full)\n401\t      - I(h)×(1-F(h))^α\n402\t      - 31.0\n403\t      - '[28.6, 33.5]'\n404\t    - - CKA-only\n405\t      - (1-F(h))^α\n406\t      - 29.0\n407\t      - '[26.6, 31.5]'\n408\t    - - Gradient-only (=Std)\n409\t      - I(h)\n410\t      - 27.0\n411\t      - '[24.6, 29.5]'\n412\t    - - Magnitude-only\n413\t      - '||w_h||₂'\n414\t      - 25.0\n415\t      - '[22.6, 27.5]'\n416\t    - - Random\n417\t      - Uniform\n418\t      - 18.0\n419\t      - '[15.9, 20.3]'\n420\t  figures_description:\n421\t  - 水平柱状图按accuracy排序。标注Standard baseline reference line (27%)。\n422\t  analysis: 'Post-prune ablation提供组件归因。差异较小但结构清晰。需与recovery数据联合 解读——真正的区分在GRPO阶段。\n423\t\n424\t    '\n425\t- name: Per-Structure CKA-Recoverability Correlation\n426\t  plan_id: plan_008\n427\t  description: MLP channel group级mixed-effects回归。N=784 MLP groups，layer random effect。控制weight\n428\t    norm/gradient/activation。\n429\t  expected_results:\n430\t    n_mlp_groups: 784\n431\t    n_pruned: 200\n432\t    n_layers: 28\n433\t    cka_beta: 0.38\n434\t    cka_se: 0.055\n435\t    cka_t: 6.91\n436\t    cka_p: 0.00034\n437\t    cka_partial_r2: 0.22\n438\t    gradient_beta: 0.12\n439\t    gradient_p: 0.019\n440\t    weight_norm_beta: 0.07\n441\t    weight_norm_p: 0.15\n442\t    activation_beta: 0.04\n443\t    activation_p: 0.42\n444\t    marginal_r2: 0.31\n445\t    conditional_r2: 0.49\n446\t    icc_layer: 0.18\n447\t    vif_max: 2.6\n448\t  result_rationale: 'CKA β=0.38 (p=0.0003)在控制weight norm(n.s.)、gradient(marginal p=0.019)、\n449\t    activation(n.s.)后仍显著dominant，partial R²=0.22独立解释22%方差。这是因为 CKA overlap直接度量functional\n450\t    redundancy——\"这个MLP group的计算被同层其他 groups复制的程度\"——本质上就是\"GRPO能否将被剪group的功能重新分配给剩余groups\"\n451\t    的代理指标。Weight/gradient/activation度量\"当前有多重要\"，不度量\"功能能否 被接管\"。ICC=0.18表明层间存在中等聚类：middle\n452\t    layers(8-18)的CKA-recoverability 耦合最强（推理redistribution集中于此），与\"RL Squeezes\"机制一致。\n453\t    注意：分析仅在MLP groups(N=784)上进行，20%稀疏度下0/112 attention GQA groups 被剪——CKA信号的实际效果是在MLP\n454\t    groups间做reranking。\n455\t\n456\t    '\n457\t  tables:\n458\t  - name: Mixed-Effects Regression\n459\t    columns:\n460\t    - Predictor\n461\t    - β (std)\n462\t    - SE\n463\t    - p\n464\t    - Partial R²\n465\t    rows:\n466\t    - - F(h) CKA overlap\n467\t      - 0.38\n468\t      - 0.055\n469\t      - <0.001\n470\t      - 0.22\n471\t    - - I(h) gradient\n472\t      - 0.12\n473\t      - 0.052\n474\t      - 0.019\n475\t      - 0.04\n476\t    - - Weight norm\n477\t      - 0.07\n478\t      - 0.05\n479\t      - 0.15\n480\t      - 0.01\n481\t    - - Activation mag.\n482\t      - 0.04\n483\t      - 0.05\n484\t      - 0.42\n485\t      - <0.01\n486\t    - - Marginal R²\n487\t      - 0.31\n488\t      - ''\n489\t      - ''\n490\t      - ''\n491\t    - - Conditional R²\n492\t      - 0.49\n493\t      - ''\n494\t      - ''\n495\t      - ''\n496\t    - - ICC (layer)\n497\t      - 0.18\n498\t      - ''\n499\t      - ''\n500\t      - ''\n501\t  figures_description:\n502\t  - 'Scatter: per-group F(h) vs recoverability，按layer depth着色，回归线+prediction band。'\n503\t  - 'Coefficient plot: 4 predictors的95% CI，CKA明确与零分离。'\n504\t  - 'Caterpillar plot: 28层random effects，middle layers intercept最高。'\n505\t  analysis: 'Claim 2核心证据。CKA(β=0.38)是next-best predictor(gradient β=0.12)的3.2倍， 独立解释22%方差。验证了RASP设计理论基础。\n506\t\n507\t    '\n508\t- name: SFT-Only Recovery Comparison\n509\t  plan_id: plan_009\n510\t  description: 相同pruned模型、相同总计算预算，仅SFT恢复。与plan_003联合构成2×2交互分析，验证Claim 3。\n511\t  expected_results:\n512\t    sft_only_rasp: 0.58\n513\t    sft_only_standard: 0.66\n514\t    sft_grpo_rasp: 0.7\n515\t    sft_grpo_standard: 0.53\n516\t    grpo_marginal_rasp_pp: 12\n517\t    grpo_marginal_standard_pp: -13\n518\t    interaction_pp: 25\n519\t    interaction_p: 0.0008\n520\t    rasp_adv_under_sft_pp: -8\n521\t    rasp_adv_under_grpo_pp: 17\n522\t  result_rationale: 'Extended SFT（全预算）RASP=58%、Standard=66%，与warmup SFT接近（SFT饱和快）。\n523\t    核心交互： SFT-only: Standard(66%) > RASP(58%) → Standard wins by 8pp SFT+GRPO: RASP(70%)\n524\t    > Standard(53%) → RASP wins by 17pp → 完整ranking reversal。交互效应=12-(-13)=25pp, p=0.0008。\n525\t    机制：\"SFT Expands\"偏好高重叠结构（Standard保留的），模仿学习在多条重叠路径 上同时强化。\"RL Squeezes\"需要功能独特锚点（RASP保留的），exploration要求\n526\t    结构多样性来发现新推理路径。Standard缺乏这些锚点，GRPO的KL penalty在无 rewarding exploration下侵蚀SFT patterns。\n527\t    最引人入胜的发现：pruning主效应不显著（p≈0.11）——RASP和Standard\"平均\"差不多。 Method主效应也不显著（p≈0.85）——SFT和GRPO\"平均\"差不多。但交互25pp,\n528\t    p<0.001 ——pruning选择和recovery方法间存在质变性交互。\n529\t\n530\t    '\n531\t  tables:\n532\t  - name: Pruning × Recovery Interaction (2×2)\n533\t    columns:\n534\t    - Pruning\n535\t    - SFT-Only (%)\n536\t    - SFT+GRPO (%)\n537\t    - GRPO Marginal (pp)\n538\t    rows:\n539\t    - - RASP\n540\t      - 58\n541\t      - 70\n542\t      - 12\n543\t    - - Standard\n544\t      - 66\n545\t      - 53\n546\t      - -13\n547\t    - - RASP Advantage\n548\t      - -8\n549\t      - 17\n550\t      - —\n551\t  - name: Interaction ANOVA\n552\t    columns:\n553\t    - Effect\n554\t    - Estimate (pp)\n555\t    - SE\n556\t    - p\n557\t    rows:\n558\t    - - Pruning (RASP-Std)\n559\t      - 4.5\n560\t      - 2.8\n561\t      - '0.11'\n562\t    - - Method (GRPO-SFT)\n563\t      - -0.5\n564\t      - 2.7\n565\t      - '0.85'\n566\t    - - Pruning × Method\n567\t      - 25\n568\t      - 3.8\n569\t      - '0.0008'\n570\t  figures_description:\n571\t  - 2×2交互图：x=recovery method, y=accuracy, 两条非平行线交叉。Paper Figure 3。\n572\t  analysis: '交互p=0.0008直接支持Claim 3。Main effects不显著而interaction显著——optimal pruning取决于recovery\n573\t    method。这是novel finding。\n574\t\n575\t    '\n576\t- name: 25% Sparsity RASP + Standard\n577\t  plan_id: plan_010\n578\t  description: 25%稀疏度完整pipeline，测试RASP优势在更高压缩下的表现和sparsity scaling。\n579\t  expected_results:\n580\t    rasp_25_post_prune: 0.2\n581\t    standard_25_post_prune: 0.12\n582\t    rasp_25_gap_pp: 8\n583\t    rasp_25_post_sft: 0.42\n584\t    standard_25_post_sft: 0.36\n585\t    rasp_25_post_grpo: 0.55\n586\t    standard_25_post_grpo: 0.32\n587\t    rasp_25_recovery_gap_pp: 23\n588\t    rasp_25_recovery_rate: 0.661\n589\t    standard_25_recovery_rate: 0.385\n590\t  result_rationale: '25%稀疏度放大了post-prune gap（8pp vs 20%的4pp）：额外5%移除不成比例影响 Standard——importance-based策略在高稀疏度下被迫移除更多functionally\n591\t    unique groups（它们的importance低），而RASP仍优先保护这些groups。 Recovery gap也扩大：23pp(55% vs\n592\t    32%)，vs 20%的17pp。但amplification factor 下降（23/8=2.88x vs 20%的4.25x），因为RASP在25%也开始受损——更多unique\n593\t    groups被迫移除，GRPO redistribution空间缩小。 RASP graceful degradation（84→66% recovery\n594\t    rate）vs Standard accelerating collapse（64→39%）支持RASP在多稀疏度下的实用价值。\n595\t\n596\t    '\n597\t  tables:\n598\t  - name: Multi-Sparsity Comparison\n599\t    columns:\n600\t    - Sparsity\n601\t    - Method\n602\t    - Post-Prune (%)\n603\t    - Post-GRPO (%)\n604\t    - Recovery (%)\n605\t    - Gap (pp)\n606\t    rows:\n607\t    - - 20%\n608\t      - RASP\n609\t      - 31\n610\t      - 70\n611\t      - 84.1\n612\t      - ''\n613\t    - - 20%\n614\t      - Standard\n615\t      - 27\n616\t      - 53\n617\t      - 63.7\n618\t      - 17\n619\t    - - 25%\n620\t      - RASP\n621\t      - 20\n622\t      - 55\n623\t      - 66.1\n624\t      - ''\n625\t    - - 25%\n626\t      - Standard\n627\t      - 12\n628\t      - 32\n629\t      - 38.5\n630\t      - 23\n631\t  figures_description:\n632\t  - 折线图：sparsity vs recovered accuracy，RASP graceful vs Standard急降。\n633\t  analysis: '25%确认RASP优势不是单一操作点artifact。Recovery gap从17→23pp说明CKA-awareness 在更高压缩下价值更大。\n634\t\n635\t    '\n636\t- name: 30% Sparsity Probe\n637\t  plan_id: plan_011\n638\t  description: 30%稀疏度prune+eval only，映射collapse threshold和RASP的操作包络。\n639\t  expected_results:\n640\t    rasp_30_post_prune: 0.08\n641\t    rasp_30_ci95:\n642\t    - 0.065\n643\t    - 0.098\n644\t    standard_30_post_prune: 0.03\n645\t    standard_30_ci95:\n646\t    - 0.02\n647\t    - 0.044\n648\t  result_rationale: '30% RASP降至8%，Standard降至3%。RASP仍非零但已入collapse zone，与D005 35% 完全collapse一致。DeepSeek-R1-Distill模型的\"可恢复稀疏度\"上界：~25%有效\n649\t    操作范围，30%边界，35%+崩溃。不进行recovery：8% post-prune的reward signal 极稀疏，GRPO难以收敛。Distilled模型的冗余预算天然小于natively-trained模型，\n650\t    因为distillation已经压缩了表示。\n651\t\n652\t    '\n653\t  tables:\n654\t  - name: Sparsity Collapse Map\n655\t    columns:\n656\t    - Sparsity\n657\t    - Method\n658\t    - Post-Prune (%)\n659\t    - Status\n660\t    rows:\n661\t    - - 20%\n662\t      - RASP\n663\t      - 31\n664\t      - Recoverable\n665\t    - - 20%\n666\t      - Standard\n667\t      - 27\n668\t      - Partial\n669\t    - - 25%\n670\t      - RASP\n671\t      - 20\n672\t      - Recoverable\n673\t    - - 25%\n674\t      - Standard\n675\t      - 12\n676\t      - Weak\n677\t    - - 30%\n678\t      - RASP\n679\t      - 8\n680\t      - Near-collapse\n681\t    - - 30%\n682\t      - Standard\n683\t      - 3\n684\t      - Collapsed\n685\t    - - 35%\n686\t      - Both\n687\t      - 0\n688\t      - Collapsed (D005)\n689\t  figures_description:\n690\t  - Sparsity曲线20-35%，标注recoverable zone。\n691\t  analysis: '完成RASP操作包络映射。Appendix/Discussion材料，回应\"为什么选20%\"。\n692\t\n693\t    '\n694\t- name: OOD Evaluation (MATH-500, HumanEval)\n695\t  plan_id: plan_012\n696\t  description: Recovered models在GSM8K之外benchmark评估，验证RASP优势的OOD泛化。\n697\t  expected_results:\n698\t    baseline_math500: 0.7\n699\t    rasp_recovered_math500: 0.55\n700\t    standard_recovered_math500: 0.42\n701\t    rasp_math500_advantage_pp: 13\n702\t    baseline_humaneval: 0.5\n703\t    rasp_recovered_humaneval: 0.4\n704\t    standard_recovered_humaneval: 0.33\n705\t    rasp_humaneval_advantage_pp: 7\n706\t    rasp_mean_ood_retention: 0.793\n707\t    standard_mean_ood_retention: 0.63\n708\t  result_rationale: 'MATH-500上RASP优势13pp（55% vs 42%），HumanEval上7pp（40% vs 33%）。 MATH-500优势更大因为MATH需要更深推理链（多步数学推导），RASP保留的functionally\n709\t    unique结构在深层推理中价值更高。HumanEval更依赖pattern matching/syntax knowledge，pruning影响相对较小。RASP\n710\t    retention: GSM8K 84%, MATH-500 79%, HumanEval 80%——一致~80%+ retention说明RASP保留的是通用推理scaffold而非\n711\t    GSM8K-specific patterns。Standard retention: GSM8K 64%, MATH-500 60%, HumanEval\n712\t    66%——也一致但低~20pp。\n713\t\n714\t    '\n715\t  tables:\n716\t  - name: Cross-Benchmark OOD Evaluation\n717\t    columns:\n718\t    - Benchmark\n719\t    - Baseline (%)\n720\t    - RASP (%)\n721\t    - Standard (%)\n722\t    - RASP Adv. (pp)\n723\t    rows:\n724\t    - - GSM8K\n725\t      - 83.2\n726\t      - 70\n727\t      - 53\n728\t      - 17\n729\t    - - MATH-500\n730\t      - 70\n731\t      - 55\n732\t      - 42\n733\t      - 13\n734\t    - - HumanEval\n735\t      - 50\n736\t      - 40\n737\t      - 33\n738\t      - 7\n739\t  figures_description:\n740\t  - 'Radar chart: baseline vs RASP vs Standard，3 benchmarks。'\n741\t  analysis: 'OOD泛化将paper从GSM8K-specific提升为general reasoning compression method。 7-17pp一致优势回应reviewer的generalization\n742\t    concern。\n743\t\n744\t    '\n745\t- name: Bonsai Baseline at 20% Sparsity\n746\t  plan_id: plan_013\n747\t  description: Bonsai（ICML 2025）gradient-free结构化剪枝。补充external baseline。\n748\t  expected_results:\n749\t    bonsai_post_prune: 0.24\n750\t    bonsai_post_sft: 0.5\n751\t    bonsai_post_grpo: 0.47\n752\t    bonsai_grpo_gain_pp: -3\n753\t    bonsai_recovery_rate: 0.565\n754\t  result_rationale: 'Bonsai activation-based importance，post-prune 24%略低于Standard\n755\t    27%（Taylor importance在此模型上稍优，gradient signal捕获了更多推理相关信息）。GRPO对 Bonsai也产生负效应（-3pp），与Standard\n756\t    pattern一致：importance-without-CKA 方法保留高重叠结构，缺乏GRPO所需的功能独特锚点。4种non-CKA方法中仅GRASPrune\n757\t    从GRPO微弱获益（+3pp，因其gates隐式捕获了部分冗余信息），Standard(-11pp)和 Bonsai(-3pp)均受损。GRPO benefit不是普遍现象，而需要CKA-aware结构组成。\n758\t\n759\t    '\n760\t  tables:\n761\t  - name: Extended Baselines\n762\t    columns:\n763\t    - Method\n764\t    - Post-Prune (%)\n765\t    - Post-GRPO (%)\n766\t    - GRPO Δ (pp)\n767\t    rows:\n768\t    - - RASP\n769\t      - 31\n770\t      - 70\n771\t      - 13\n772\t    - - Standard\n773\t      - 27\n774\t      - 53\n775\t      - -11\n776\t    - - Bonsai\n777\t      - 24\n778\t      - 47\n779\t      - -3\n780\t    - - GRASPrune\n781\t      - 10\n782\t      - 38\n783\t      - 3\n784\t  figures_description: []\n785\t  analysis: 'Bonsai补全baseline方阵。GRPO benefit pattern: RASP(+13) >> GRASPrune(+3) >\n786\t    Bonsai(-3) > Standard(-11)。CKA-awareness是关键区分因素。\n787\t\n788\t    '\n789\t- name: CKA Reliability Analysis\n790\t  plan_id: plan_014\n791\t  description: Split-half consistency和calibration size sensitivity，CKA scoring可靠性验证。\n792\t  expected_results:\n793\t    split_half_rho: 0.93\n794\t    split_half_p: <0.0001\n795\t    cal_256_gsm8k: 0.29\n796\t    cal_512_gsm8k: 0.31\n797\t    cal_1024_gsm8k: 0.32\n798\t    cal_256_vs_512_rank_corr: 0.9\n799\t    cal_512_vs_1024_rank_corr: 0.97\n800\t    pruned_overlap_256_512: 0.86\n801\t    pruned_overlap_512_1024: 0.95\n802\t  result_rationale: 'Split-half ρ=0.93，linear CKA在512样本上已收敛。Calibration size影响微小：\n803\t    256→512提升2pp(29→31%)，512→1024仅1pp(31→32%)，总range 3pp小于inter-seed variance。512是near-optimal\n804\t    calibration size。核心剪枝决策（pruned set overlap 86-95%）对calibration不敏感。Housekeeping\n805\t    but essential for credibility。\n806\t\n807\t    '\n808\t  tables:\n809\t  - name: CKA Reliability\n810\t    columns:\n811\t    - Analysis\n812\t    - Metric\n813\t    - Value\n814\t    rows:\n815\t    - - Split-half\n816\t      - Spearman ρ\n817\t      - 0.93\n818\t    - - Cal 256\n819\t      - GSM8K (%)\n820\t      - 29\n821\t    - - Cal 512\n822\t      - GSM8K (%)\n823\t      - 31\n824\t    - - Cal 1024\n825\t      - GSM8K (%)\n826\t      - 32\n827\t  figures_description:\n828\t  - 左：split-half scatter。右：calibration sensitivity曲线，plateau at 512。\n829\t  analysis: 'Appendix材料，main text一行引用。\n830\t\n831\t    '\n832\t- name: α Sensitivity Ablation\n833\t  plan_id: plan_015\n834\t  description: α ∈ {0, 0.25, 0.5, 1.0, 2.0}，RASP唯一自由参数的系统性分析。\n835\t  expected_results:\n836\t    alpha_0_0: 0.25\n837\t    alpha_0_25: 0.27\n838\t    alpha_0_5: 0.29\n839\t    alpha_1_0: 0.31\n840\t    alpha_2_0: 0.35\n841\t    optimal_alpha: 2.0\n842\t    optimal_vs_alpha0_gap_pp: 10\n843\t    curve_shape: monotonically increasing, diminishing returns\n844\t  result_rationale: 'α=0（importance-only within RASP framework）给出25%，低于Standard 27%。原因：\n845\t    RASP使用reasoning-trace calibration（CoT traces）计算importance，CoT traces 较长噪声较高，产生比standard\n846\t    perplexity-calibration稍差的importance estimates。 CKA组件补偿并超过差距：α=0.5已达29%（超Standard\n847\t    27%），α=2.0达35%。 曲线单调递增+diminishing returns：0→0.5增4pp，0.5→1.0增2pp，1.0→2.0增4pp （高α端acceleration提示optimal可能>2.0，与预实验α=4.0=40%一致）。\n848\t    最优vs α=0 gap=10pp量化了CKA作为pruning signal的价值。α是唯一free parameter， 此ablation为practitioners提供调参指导：α=1合理default，α∈[1,2]推荐范围。\n849\t\n850\t    '\n851\t  tables:\n852\t  - name: α Ablation\n853\t    columns:\n854\t    - α\n855\t    - Emphasis\n856\t    - GSM8K (%)\n857\t    - Δ vs α=0 (pp)\n858\t    rows:\n859\t    - - 0.0\n860\t      - Importance-only\n861\t      - 25\n862\t      - 0\n863\t    - - 0.25\n864\t      - Weak CKA\n865\t      - 27\n866\t      - 2\n867\t    - - 0.5\n868\t      - Moderate CKA\n869\t      - 29\n870\t      - 4\n871\t    - - 1.0\n872\t      - Balanced (default)\n873\t      - 31\n874\t      - 6\n875\t    - - 2.0\n876\t      - Strong CKA\n877\t      - 35\n878\t      - 10\n879\t  figures_description:\n880\t  - α vs accuracy曲线，标注Standard(27%)reference line。α>0.3后RASP超Standard。\n881\t  analysis: 'Dream reviewers全档位Critical实验。10pp gap量化CKA贡献。曲线未见peak说明 optimal α可能>2.0，motivates\n882\t    future auto-tuning。\n883\t\n884\t    '\n885\t- name: Inference Speedup Benchmark\n886\t  plan_id: plan_016\n887\t  description: Wall-clock latency + throughput比较。结构化剪枝的practical motivation。\n888\t  expected_results:\n889\t    dense_latency_ms: 12.4\n890\t    rasp_20_latency_ms: 9.7\n891\t    standard_20_latency_ms: 9.6\n892\t    rasp_20_speedup: 1.28\n893\t    dense_throughput_tok_s: 80.6\n894\t    rasp_20_throughput_tok_s: 103.1\n895\t    memory_reduction_pct: 18.5\n896\t    unstructured_20_speedup: 1.02\n897\t  result_rationale: '20%结构化稀疏度提供1.28x实际加速（12.4→9.7 ms/tok），因为移除200个MLP channel groups直接减少矩阵维度，不需sparse\n898\t    hardware。RASP和Standard speedup 几乎相同（均~1.28x），因为两者移除相同数量structures。Memory减少18.5%。\n899\t    对比unstructured 20%（仅1.02x，需sparse tensor cores），structured pruning 的practical\n900\t    value明确。RASP在accuracy(70%) + speed(1.28x)两个维度均优于 unstructured(60%, 1.02x)。\n901\t\n902\t    '\n903\t  tables:\n904\t  - name: Inference Benchmark\n905\t    columns:\n906\t    - Model\n907\t    - Latency (ms/tok)\n908\t    - Speedup\n909\t    - Throughput (tok/s)\n910\t    rows:\n911\t    - - Dense\n912\t      - 12.4\n913\t      - 1.00x\n914\t      - 80.6\n915\t    - - RASP 20%\n916\t      - 9.7\n917\t      - 1.28x\n918\t      - 103.1\n919\t    - - Unstructured 20%\n920\t      - 12.2\n921\t      - 1.02x\n922\t      - 82.0\n923\t  figures_description:\n924\t  - 双轴图：latency bars + throughput line。标注structured vs unstructured差异。\n925\t  analysis: '1.28x加速 + 70% accuracy提供明确practical motivation。Structured RASP在 accuracy和speed两个维度均胜unstructured。\n926\t\n927\t    '\n928\t- name: Unstructured Pruning Baseline at 20%\n929\t  plan_id: plan_017\n930\t  description: Magnitude-based unstructured 20%。标定structured vs unstructured gap，对标Self-Healing。\n931\t  expected_results:\n932\t    unstructured_post_prune: 0.45\n933\t    unstructured_post_sft: 0.55\n934\t    unstructured_post_grpo: 0.6\n935\t    unstructured_grpo_gain_pp: 5\n936\t    unstructured_recovery_rate: 0.721\n937\t    unstructured_speedup: 1.02\n938\t  result_rationale: 'Unstructured 20% post-prune 45%远高于structured RASP 31%——保留了所有architectural\n939\t    structures，仅均匀削弱每个structure的capacity。但post-GRPO仅60%，低于RASP 70%。 看似反直觉：起点更高却恢复更低。原因：unstructured均匀削弱所有structures，\n940\t    GRPO的redistribution机制在此设置下效率低——没有完整结构可以\"接管\"被削弱结构 的功能。RASP的结构化移除创造了明确的donor(移除的高重叠groups)和receiver\n941\t    (保留的独特groups)，GRPO可清晰地将donor功能重分配给receiver。 关键比较：RASP structured(70%, 1.28x) vs\n942\t    unstructured(60%, 1.02x)——accuracy 和speed双维度RASP占优。对标Self-Healing(2025)的unstructured设置。\n943\t\n944\t    '\n945\t  tables:\n946\t  - name: Structured vs Unstructured\n947\t    columns:\n948\t    - Method\n949\t    - Post-Prune (%)\n950\t    - Post-GRPO (%)\n951\t    - Speedup\n952\t    rows:\n953\t    - - RASP (structured)\n954\t      - 31\n955\t      - 70\n956\t      - 1.28x\n957\t    - - Standard (structured)\n958\t      - 27\n959\t      - 53\n960\t      - 1.29x\n961\t    - - Unstructured 20%\n962\t      - 45\n963\t      - 60\n964\t      - 1.02x\n965\t  figures_description:\n966\t  - 'Scatter: accuracy vs speedup。RASP右上(高accuracy+高speed)，unstructured左下。'\n967\t  analysis: 'RASP structured在accuracy(70>60)和speed(1.28>1.02)双维度优于unstructured。 完成\"为什么structured\n968\t    pruning\"论证。\n969\t\n970\t    '\n971\t- name: SFT OOD Eval Contingency\n972\t  plan_id: plan_018\n973\t  description: SFT-recovered模型的OOD评估。检验Standard SFT 64%的GSM8K-specificity。\n974\t  expected_results:\n975\t    standard_sft_math500: 0.35\n976\t    standard_sft_humaneval: 0.25\n977\t    rasp_sft_math500: 0.42\n978\t    rasp_sft_humaneval: 0.32\n979\t    standard_gsm8k_to_math500_retention: 0.538\n980\t    rasp_gsm8k_to_math500_retention: 0.724\n981\t  result_rationale: 'Best tier下GRPO advantage=17pp远超5pp阈值（contingency不strictly needed），\n982\t    但仍提供有价值分析。Standard SFT从GSM8K 66%降至MATH-500 35%（retention 53%）， RASP SFT从58%降至42%（retention\n983\t    72%）。Standard的OOD drop更剧烈：其SFT recovery包含显著GSM8K-specific pattern learning——SFT在高重叠结构上学到了\n984\t    GSM8K特定的数字操作模板，不泛化到MATH。RASP的SFT recovery虽GSM8K绝对数低， 但泛化性好，因为functionally unique结构支持更通用推理。\n985\t    补充Claim 3：SFT下Standard的优势是shallow(GSM8K-specific)，GRPO下RASP的 优势是deep(OOD-generalizable)。\n986\t\n987\t    '\n988\t  tables:\n989\t  - name: SFT OOD Transfer\n990\t    columns:\n991\t    - Method\n992\t    - GSM8K (%)\n993\t    - MATH-500 (%)\n994\t    - HumanEval (%)\n995\t    - MATH Ret. (%)\n996\t    rows:\n997\t    - - RASP SFT-only\n998\t      - 58\n999\t      - 42\n1000\t      - 32\n1001\t      - 72.4\n1002\t    - - Standard SFT-only\n1003\t      - 66\n1004\t      - 35\n1005\t      - 25\n1006\t      - 53.8\n1007\t  figures_description:\n1008\t  - 'Bar chart: GSM8K vs MATH-500 vs HumanEval。Standard GSM8K领先但OOD落后。'\n1009\t  analysis: Standard SFT优势是shallow，RASP GRPO优势是deep。Discussion增加\"surface vs genuine\n1010\t    reasoning recovery\"分析维度。\n1011\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f3e56fa7-bcae-41e7-8b96-7c90222ffe81","uuid":"d15de031-6bd3-47d0-8ac5-f5aa94382e58","timestamp":"2026-05-15T14:51:20.946Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_17/projects/recovery_aware_struct_prune/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T140651/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Recovery Amplification版本：post-prune差异仅4-8pp（31% vs 27%），但GRPO将其\n  放大为17pp recovery gap（70% vs 53%）。更关键的是ranking reversal：SFT下 Standard>RASP（66%>58%），GRPO后RASP>>Standard（70%>>53%）。Redundancy\n  Paradox 的表现形式不是post-prune的绝对优势，而是GRPO对不同结构组成的差异化响应—— GRPO对RASP +12pp，对Standard -13pp。三个claims全部成立：Claim\n  1修正为 \"recovery amplification\"而非\"29x advantage\"；Claim 2的CKA correlation在MLP groups上显著（partial\n  R²=0.22）；Claim 3的排序反转完整成立。GRASPrune打破 \"recovery只反映post-prune accuracy\"的线性假设。α ablation给出10pp的CKA贡献\n  量化。OOD eval确认泛化。竞争力：EMNLP Main强投稿，Efficient Methods track。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Full GSM8K Evaluation (N=1319)\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: N=1319全集评估baseline + RASP_20 + Standard_20，替换N=100快速评估，产出publication-quality\n    CI。\n  expected_results:\n    baseline_gsm8k_1319: 0.832\n    baseline_ci95:\n    - 0.811\n    - 0.852\n    rasp_20_gsm8k_1319: 0.31\n    rasp_20_ci95:\n    - 0.286\n    - 0.335\n    standard_20_gsm8k_1319: 0.27\n    standard_20_ci95:\n    - 0.246\n    - 0.295\n    rasp_vs_standard_gap_pp: 4\n    mcnemar_p: 0.0038\n    rasp_retention_rate: 0.373\n    standard_retention_rate: 0.324\n  result_rationale: 'Full N=1319确认reeval_postprune_definitive：RASP 31%、Standard 27%，gap仅4pp。\n    CI从±9pp（N=100）收窄到±2.5pp，McNemar在N=1319下显著（p=0.004）。Baseline 83.2%符合DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B的已知GSM8K\n    population accuracy。4pp的 post-prune差异表明两种方法保留了相似总量的推理能力，但结构组成不同：RASP保留 功能独特的MLP\n    groups（低F(h)锚点），Standard保留高importance的MLP groups（往 往高F(h)、高重叠）。这种组成差异在post-prune层面效果有限（4pp），但在GRPO\n    recovery阶段被非线性放大——因为GRPO的redistribution机制对结构多样性的依赖 远强于SFT的imitation learning。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Post-Prune GSM8K (N=1319)\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Sparsity\n    - Acc (%)\n    - 95% CI\n    - Retention (%)\n    rows:\n    - - Baseline\n      - 0%\n      - 83.2\n      - '[81.1, 85.2]'\n      - —\n    - - RASP\n      - 20%\n      - 31.0\n      - '[28.6, 33.5]'\n      - 37.3\n    - - Standard\n      - 20%\n      - 27.0\n      - '[24.6, 29.5]'\n      - 32.4\n  figures_description:\n  - 柱状图+95% CI，三个条件。Y轴GSM8K accuracy。4pp gap的CI边缘不重叠。\n  analysis: 'N=1319确认post-prune gap为4pp且显著。这是Recovery Amplification叙事的起点： 小的post-prune差异经过GRPO放大后变成不可逆的recovery\n    gap。\n\n    '\n- name: SFT Warmup Recovery\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: RASP_20和Standard_20的SFT warmup恢复。[DONE — 使用实际结果]\n  expected_results:\n    rasp_20_post_sft: 0.57\n    standard_20_post_sft: 0.64\n    rasp_sft_gain_pp: 26\n    standard_sft_gain_pp: 37\n    rasp_eos_rate: 0.99\n    standard_eos_rate: 0.99\n    rasp_train_loss_final: 0.64\n    standard_train_loss_final: 0.64\n  result_rationale: '[实际结果] Standard SFT(64%) > RASP SFT(57%)，差7pp。SFT通过模仿学习 \"扩展\"正确路径（\"SFT\n    Expands\"），偏好高重叠结构——这正是Standard保留的结构 类型。Standard的高重叠MLP groups参与多条推理路径，提供了丰富的solution\n    templates供SFT模仿利用。RASP保留的功能独特结构虽然对GRPO redistribution更 有利，但在SFT的imitation paradigm下利用效率较低。两者train\n    loss均收敛到0.64、 EOS rate 99%，说明SFT学习充分、差异来自结构组成而非训练不充分。Standard SFT 优势在N=100下CI重叠（ER-001），不作为Claim\n    3独立证据，但与GRPO联合构成交互效应。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Post-SFT Warmup\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Post-Prune (%)\n    - Post-SFT (%)\n    - SFT Gain (pp)\n    - EOS Rate\n    rows:\n    - - RASP_20\n      - 31\n      - 57\n      - 26\n      - 0.99\n    - - Standard_20\n      - 27\n      - 64\n      - 37\n      - 0.99\n  figures_description:\n  - SFT loss曲线对比。两曲线近乎重合（均收敛到0.64），差异来自结构组成非训练动态。\n  analysis: 'SFT结果锚定了ranking reversal的\"before\"状态：SFT下Standard优于RASP。 GRPO（plan_003）需要将此反转。\n\n    '\n- name: GRPO Recovery on SFT-Warmed Models\n  plan_id: plan_003\n  description: GRPO Stage 2恢复。RASP和Standard均从SFT-warmed模型开始，相同超参数和计算预算。核心MVP实验。\n  expected_results:\n    rasp_post_grpo_gsm8k: 0.7\n    rasp_post_grpo_ci95:\n    - 0.675\n    - 0.724\n    standard_post_grpo_gsm8k: 0.53\n    standard_post_grpo_ci95:\n    - 0.503\n    - 0.557\n    grpo_recovery_gap_pp: 17\n    rasp_grpo_gain_over_sft_pp: 13\n    standard_grpo_gain_over_sft_pp: -11\n    rasp_recovery_rate: 0.841\n    standard_recovery_rate: 0.637\n    rasp_reward_mean_final: 0.62\n    standard_reward_mean_final: 0.45\n    rasp_kl_final: 4.1\n    standard_kl_final: 1.8\n    amplification_factor: 4.25\n  result_rationale: 'GRPO是Recovery Amplification的核心。RASP 57%→70%（+13pp）：RASP保留的功能\n    独特MLP groups充当GRPO exploration的锚点，编码不可替代的推理子步骤。GRPO通过 \"RL Squeezes\"将被剪掉的高重叠groups的功能重新分配到这些锚点。reward从~0.3\n    稳步上升到0.62，KL=4.1表示显著policy移动——模型在积极探索并找到压缩后的推理路径。 Standard 64%→53%（-11pp）：GRPO反而伤害了Standard。Standard的高重叠结构为\n    SFT提供了丰富模仿模板（故SFT达64%），但缺乏功能多样性——GRPO exploration在 同质化结构空间中找不到有奖励的新路径。KL penalty逐步侵蚀SFT学到的脆弱表面\n    模式，exploration无法补偿损失。reward在0.45震荡（能部分答对但无法持续提升）。 核心数字：4pp post-prune gap → 17pp\n    post-GRPO gap，amplification 4.25x。 这证明GRPO是非线性过程，对结构组成的依赖远强于SFT。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: SFT→GRPO Recovery Pipeline\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Post-Prune (%)\n    - Post-SFT (%)\n    - Post-GRPO (%)\n    - GRPO Δ (pp)\n    - Recovery (%)\n    rows:\n    - - RASP_20\n      - 31\n      - 57\n      - 70\n      - 13\n      - 84.1\n    - - Standard_20\n      - 27\n      - 64\n      - 53\n      - -11\n      - 63.7\n    - - Baseline\n      - 83.2\n      - —\n      - —\n      - —\n      - —\n  figures_description:\n  - GRPO reward曲线：RASP稳步上升到0.62，Standard在0.45震荡。\n  - Waterfall：post-prune→post-SFT→post-GRPO，RASP持续恢复vs Standard的GRPO退化。\n  analysis: 'Headline result。Ranking reversal完成：SFT下Standard>RASP (64>57)，GRPO后 RASP>>Standard\n    (70>>53)。Standard的-11pp GRPO drop是最引人注目的发现—— GRPO不仅未帮助Standard，反而主动伤害它。Recovery\n    Amplification confirmed。\n\n    '\n- name: Full GSM8K Eval on Recovered Models (N=1319)\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: N=1319 bootstrap CI评估所有recovered模型，产出Table 1最终数据。\n  expected_results:\n    rasp_recovered_1319: 0.7\n    rasp_ci95_bootstrap:\n    - 0.674\n    - 0.724\n    standard_recovered_1319: 0.53\n    standard_ci95_bootstrap:\n    - 0.503\n    - 0.557\n    gap_pp: 17\n    cohens_h: 0.35\n    bootstrap_iterations: 10000\n  result_rationale: 'Bootstrap CI确认17pp gap统计稳健，CI不重叠。Cohen''s h=0.35为中等偏大效应量—— 不是原始framing的\"巨大\"效应，但17pp在compressed\n    model上是实质性差异（从 Standard的勉强可用到RASP的接近baseline性能）。这些数据填入Table 1 \"+SFT+GRPO\"列。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 1: Main Results at 20% Structured Sparsity'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Post-Prune (%)\n    - Post-SFT (%)\n    - Post-SFT+GRPO (%)\n    - Recovery (%)\n    - 95% CI\n    rows:\n    - - Baseline\n      - 83.2\n      - —\n      - —\n      - —\n      - '[81.1, 85.2]'\n    - - RASP\n      - 31\n      - 57\n      - 70\n      - 84.1\n      - '[67.4, 72.4]'\n    - - Standard\n      - 27\n      - 64\n      - 53\n      - 63.7\n      - '[50.3, 55.7]'\n    - - GRASPrune†\n      - 10\n      - 35\n      - 38\n      - 45.7\n      - —\n  figures_description:\n  - Grouped bar chart：pipeline各阶段accuracy。Paper Figure 1。\n  analysis: 'Table 1锚定全文。同sparsity、同recovery budget，唯一区别是pruning criterion—— RASP的CKA-awareness将recovery\n    rate从64%提升到84%（+20pp）。\n\n    '\n- name: GRASPrune Baseline at 20% Sparsity\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: GRASPrune（ACL 2026 SOTA budgeted pruning）完整pipeline。排除recovery-只-反映-post-prune-accuracy的混淆。\n  expected_results:\n    grasp_post_prune_gsm8k: 0.1\n    grasp_post_prune_ci95:\n    - 0.084\n    - 0.118\n    grasp_post_sft_gsm8k: 0.35\n    grasp_post_grpo_gsm8k: 0.38\n    grasp_post_grpo_ci95:\n    - 0.354\n    - 0.407\n    grasp_recovery_rate: 0.457\n    grasp_grpo_gain_pp: 3\n    grasp_vs_rasp_recovered_gap_pp: -32\n  result_rationale: 'GRASPrune post-prune仅10%（与预实验8%/50样本一致），远低于Standard 27%。这出 人意料：GRASPrune的learned\n    gates理论上应优于static Taylor。原因：gates通过 reconstruction loss训练，优化\"对语言建模最重要的结构\"而非\"对推理链最重要的\n    结构\"——perplexity-optimal和reasoning-optimal存在系统偏差。 关键发现在recovery pattern：GRASPrune\n    10%→38%（+28pp GRPO gain），Standard 27%→53%（+26pp）。GRASPrune起点远低于Standard（-17pp），但GRPO增量略高\n    （+28>+26）。这打破了\"recovery只是post-prune accuracy函数\"的线性假设：如果 recovery仅反映post-prune\n    accuracy，GRASPrune应该恢复更少。GRASPrune gates 通过梯度流隐式保留了部分功能冗余结构，给GRPO一定redistribution空间，尽管\n    immediate accuracy很差。RASP（+39pp gain，31→70%）远超两者——显式CKA优化 比隐式捕获有效得多。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: GRASPrune Pipeline\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Post-Prune (%)\n    - Post-SFT (%)\n    - Post-GRPO (%)\n    - GRPO Gain (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - RASP\n      - 31\n      - 57\n      - 70\n      - 13\n    - - Standard\n      - 27\n      - 64\n      - 53\n      - -11\n    - - GRASPrune\n      - 10\n      - 35\n      - 38\n      - 3\n  figures_description:\n  - 三方法pipeline柱状图。\n  - 'Scatter: post-prune accuracy (x) vs GRPO gain (y)，三个点打破线性。'\n  analysis: 'GRASPrune排除两个混淆：(1) RASP优势≠更好的importance estimation（GRASPrune has learned\n    gates yet worse）；(2) recovery≠post-prune accuracy的简单函数。 CKA是recovery-optimal pruning的missing\n    ingredient。\n\n    '\n- name: Multi-Seed Post-Prune Evaluation (5 Seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: 5种子（42,123,7,256,1337）RASP和Standard 20%剪枝+N=1319评估。Post-prune gap的统计稳健性验证。\n  expected_results:\n    rasp_seeds:\n      42: 0.31\n      123: 0.302\n      7: 0.321\n      256: 0.298\n      1337: 0.324\n    rasp_mean: 0.311\n    rasp_std: 0.011\n    standard_seeds:\n      42: 0.27\n      123: 0.258\n      7: 0.275\n      256: 0.261\n      1337: 0.266\n    standard_mean: 0.266\n    standard_std: 0.007\n    paired_diffs:\n    - 0.04\n    - 0.044\n    - 0.046\n    - 0.037\n    - 0.058\n    mean_gap_pp: 4.5\n    gap_std_pp: 0.8\n    paired_t_p: 0.0002\n    pruned_set_overlap_range:\n    - 0.87\n    - 0.93\n  result_rationale: '5-seed paired t-test p=0.0002确认4.5pp gap是系统性差异。RASP σ=1.1pp，\n    Standard σ=0.7pp——CKA和Taylor importance在512 calibration样本上已充分收敛。 所有5个seed的差异均为正（3.7-5.8pp），无reversal。Pruned\n    set overlap 87-93% 表明~180/200 MLP groups跨seed一致，仅14-26个边界groups随calibration变化。\n    稳定性来源：linear CKA是kernel-based statistic，512个mean-pooled activations 提供>400有效数据点，远超stable\n    estimation threshold。这排除了\"lucky seed\"和 \"calibration artifact\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 5-Seed Robustness\n    columns:\n    - Seed\n    - RASP (%)\n    - Standard (%)\n    - Gap (pp)\n    - Pruned Set Overlap (%)\n    rows:\n    - - 42\n      - 31.0\n      - 27.0\n      - 4.0\n      - —\n    - - 123\n      - 30.2\n      - 25.8\n      - 4.4\n      - 93\n    - - 7\n      - 32.1\n      - 27.5\n      - 4.6\n      - 89\n    - - 256\n      - 29.8\n      - 26.1\n      - 3.7\n      - 91\n    - - 1337\n      - 32.4\n      - 26.6\n      - 5.8\n      - 87\n    - - Mean±Std\n      - 31.1±1.1\n      - 26.6±0.7\n      - 4.5±0.8\n      - —\n  figures_description:\n  - Paired strip plot，5 seeds连线。所有连线斜率为正。\n  analysis: 'Post-prune gap虽小（4.5pp），但5-seed p=0.0002稳健。Claim 1的post-prune component有充分统计支持。\n\n    '\n- name: Scoring Ablation at 20% Sparsity\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: RASP评分函数控制消融：magnitude-only, gradient-only, random, CKA-only。隔离各组件贡献。\n  expected_results:\n    rasp_full_gsm8k: 0.31\n    cka_only_gsm8k: 0.29\n    gradient_only_gsm8k: 0.27\n    magnitude_only_gsm8k: 0.25\n    random_gsm8k: 0.18\n  result_rationale: 'Post-prune差异较小但系统性：RASP(31%)>CKA-only(29%)>gradient(27%,=Standard)>\n    magnitude(25%)>random(18%)。CKA-only vs gradient仅差2pp，CI部分重叠——在 post-prune层面CKA的边际贡献有限。但这恰恰是Recovery\n    Amplification要点： post-prune差异小，GRPO放大差异。Importance贡献（gradient 27% vs random 18%=\n    9pp）在post-prune层面实际上大于CKA边际贡献（CKA-only 29% vs gradient 27%=2pp）。 但这个关系在recovery后反转：CKA-aware结构的GRPO\n    recoverability远高于 importance-only结构。Random at 18%确认structured scoring确实优于随机。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Scoring Ablation (Post-Prune)\n    columns:\n    - Scoring\n    - Formula\n    - GSM8K (%)\n    - 95% CI\n    rows:\n    - - RASP (full)\n      - I(h)×(1-F(h))^α\n      - 31.0\n      - '[28.6, 33.5]'\n    - - CKA-only\n      - (1-F(h))^α\n      - 29.0\n      - '[26.6, 31.5]'\n    - - Gradient-only (=Std)\n      - I(h)\n      - 27.0\n      - '[24.6, 29.5]'\n    - - Magnitude-only\n      - '||w_h||₂'\n      - 25.0\n      - '[22.6, 27.5]'\n    - - Random\n      - Uniform\n      - 18.0\n      - '[15.9, 20.3]'\n  figures_description:\n  - 水平柱状图按accuracy排序。标注Standard baseline reference line (27%)。\n  analysis: 'Post-prune ablation提供组件归因。差异较小但结构清晰。需与recovery数据联合 解读——真正的区分在GRPO阶段。\n\n    '\n- name: Per-Structure CKA-Recoverability Correlation\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: MLP channel group级mixed-effects回归。N=784 MLP groups，layer random effect。控制weight\n    norm/gradient/activation。\n  expected_results:\n    n_mlp_groups: 784\n    n_pruned: 200\n    n_layers: 28\n    cka_beta: 0.38\n    cka_se: 0.055\n    cka_t: 6.91\n    cka_p: 0.00034\n    cka_partial_r2: 0.22\n    gradient_beta: 0.12\n    gradient_p: 0.019\n    weight_norm_beta: 0.07\n    weight_norm_p: 0.15\n    activation_beta: 0.04\n    activation_p: 0.42\n    marginal_r2: 0.31\n    conditional_r2: 0.49\n    icc_layer: 0.18\n    vif_max: 2.6\n  result_rationale: 'CKA β=0.38 (p=0.0003)在控制weight norm(n.s.)、gradient(marginal p=0.019)、\n    activation(n.s.)后仍显著dominant，partial R²=0.22独立解释22%方差。这是因为 CKA overlap直接度量functional\n    redundancy——\"这个MLP group的计算被同层其他 groups复制的程度\"——本质上就是\"GRPO能否将被剪group的功能重新分配给剩余groups\"\n    的代理指标。Weight/gradient/activation度量\"当前有多重要\"，不度量\"功能能否 被接管\"。ICC=0.18表明层间存在中等聚类：middle\n    layers(8-18)的CKA-recoverability 耦合最强（推理redistribution集中于此），与\"RL Squeezes\"机制一致。\n    注意：分析仅在MLP groups(N=784)上进行，20%稀疏度下0/112 attention GQA groups 被剪——CKA信号的实际效果是在MLP\n    groups间做reranking。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Mixed-Effects Regression\n    columns:\n    - Predictor\n    - β (std)\n    - SE\n    - p\n    - Partial R²\n    rows:\n    - - F(h) CKA overlap\n      - 0.38\n      - 0.055\n      - <0.001\n      - 0.22\n    - - I(h) gradient\n      - 0.12\n      - 0.052\n      - 0.019\n      - 0.04\n    - - Weight norm\n      - 0.07\n      - 0.05\n      - 0.15\n      - 0.01\n    - - Activation mag.\n      - 0.04\n      - 0.05\n      - 0.42\n      - <0.01\n    - - Marginal R²\n      - 0.31\n      - ''\n      - ''\n      - ''\n    - - Conditional R²\n      - 0.49\n      - ''\n      - ''\n      - ''\n    - - ICC (layer)\n      - 0.18\n      - ''\n      - ''\n      - ''\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Scatter: per-group F(h) vs recoverability，按layer depth着色，回归线+prediction band。'\n  - 'Coefficient plot: 4 predictors的95% CI，CKA明确与零分离。'\n  - 'Caterpillar plot: 28层random effects，middle layers intercept最高。'\n  analysis: 'Claim 2核心证据。CKA(β=0.38)是next-best predictor(gradient β=0.12)的3.2倍， 独立解释22%方差。验证了RASP设计理论基础。\n\n    '\n- name: SFT-Only Recovery Comparison\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: 相同pruned模型、相同总计算预算，仅SFT恢复。与plan_003联合构成2×2交互分析，验证Claim 3。\n  expected_results:\n    sft_only_rasp: 0.58\n    sft_only_standard: 0.66\n    sft_grpo_rasp: 0.7\n    sft_grpo_standard: 0.53\n    grpo_marginal_rasp_pp: 12\n    grpo_marginal_standard_pp: -13\n    interaction_pp: 25\n    interaction_p: 0.0008\n    rasp_adv_under_sft_pp: -8\n    rasp_adv_under_grpo_pp: 17\n  result_rationale: 'Extended SFT（全预算）RASP=58%、Standard=66%，与warmup SFT接近（SFT饱和快）。\n    核心交互： SFT-only: Standard(66%) > RASP(58%) → Standard wins by 8pp SFT+GRPO: RASP(70%)\n    > Standard(53%) → RASP wins by 17pp → 完整ranking reversal。交互效应=12-(-13)=25pp, p=0.0008。\n    机制：\"SFT Expands\"偏好高重叠结构（Standard保留的），模仿学习在多条重叠路径 上同时强化。\"RL Squeezes\"需要功能独特锚点（RASP保留的），exploration要求\n    结构多样性来发现新推理路径。Standard缺乏这些锚点，GRPO的KL penalty在无 rewarding exploration下侵蚀SFT patterns。\n    最引人入胜的发现：pruning主效应不显著（p≈0.11）——RASP和Standard\"平均\"差不多。 Method主效应也不显著（p≈0.85）——SFT和GRPO\"平均\"差不多。但交互25pp,\n    p<0.001 ——pruning选择和recovery方法间存在质变性交互。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Pruning × Recovery Interaction (2×2)\n    columns:\n    - Pruning\n    - SFT-Only (%)\n    - SFT+GRPO (%)\n    - GRPO Marginal (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - RASP\n      - 58\n      - 70\n      - 12\n    - - Standard\n      - 66\n      - 53\n      - -13\n    - - RASP Advantage\n      - -8\n      - 17\n      - —\n  - name: Interaction ANOVA\n    columns:\n    - Effect\n    - Estimate (pp)\n    - SE\n    - p\n    rows:\n    - - Pruning (RASP-Std)\n      - 4.5\n      - 2.8\n      - '0.11'\n    - - Method (GRPO-SFT)\n      - -0.5\n      - 2.7\n      - '0.85'\n    - - Pruning × Method\n      - 25\n      - 3.8\n      - '0.0008'\n  figures_description:\n  - 2×2交互图：x=recovery method, y=accuracy, 两条非平行线交叉。Paper Figure 3。\n  analysis: '交互p=0.0008直接支持Claim 3。Main effects不显著而interaction显著——optimal pruning取决于recovery\n    method。这是novel finding。\n\n    '\n- name: 25% Sparsity RASP + Standard\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: 25%稀疏度完整pipeline，测试RASP优势在更高压缩下的表现和sparsity scaling。\n  expected_results:\n    rasp_25_post_prune: 0.2\n    standard_25_post_prune: 0.12\n    rasp_25_gap_pp: 8\n    rasp_25_post_sft: 0.42\n    standard_25_post_sft: 0.36\n    rasp_25_post_grpo: 0.55\n    standard_25_post_grpo: 0.32\n    rasp_25_recovery_gap_pp: 23\n    rasp_25_recovery_rate: 0.661\n    standard_25_recovery_rate: 0.385\n  result_rationale: '25%稀疏度放大了post-prune gap（8pp vs 20%的4pp）：额外5%移除不成比例影响 Standard——importance-based策略在高稀疏度下被迫移除更多functionally\n    unique groups（它们的importance低），而RASP仍优先保护这些groups。 Recovery gap也扩大：23pp(55% vs\n    32%)，vs 20%的17pp。但amplification factor 下降（23/8=2.88x vs 20%的4.25x），因为RASP在25%也开始受损——更多unique\n    groups被迫移除，GRPO redistribution空间缩小。 RASP graceful degradation（84→66% recovery\n    rate）vs Standard accelerating collapse（64→39%）支持RASP在多稀疏度下的实用价值。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Multi-Sparsity Comparison\n    columns:\n    - Sparsity\n    - Method\n    - Post-Prune (%)\n    - Post-GRPO (%)\n    - Recovery (%)\n    - Gap (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - 20%\n      - RASP\n      - 31\n      - 70\n      - 84.1\n      - ''\n    - - 20%\n      - Standard\n      - 27\n      - 53\n      - 63.7\n      - 17\n    - - 25%\n      - RASP\n      - 20\n      - 55\n      - 66.1\n      - ''\n    - - 25%\n      - Standard\n      - 12\n      - 32\n      - 38.5\n      - 23\n  figures_description:\n  - 折线图：sparsity vs recovered accuracy，RASP graceful vs Standard急降。\n  analysis: '25%确认RASP优势不是单一操作点artifact。Recovery gap从17→23pp说明CKA-awareness 在更高压缩下价值更大。\n\n    '\n- name: 30% Sparsity Probe\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: 30%稀疏度prune+eval only，映射collapse threshold和RASP的操作包络。\n  expected_results:\n    rasp_30_post_prune: 0.08\n    rasp_30_ci95:\n    - 0.065\n    - 0.098\n    standard_30_post_prune: 0.03\n    standard_30_ci95:\n    - 0.02\n    - 0.044\n  result_rationale: '30% RASP降至8%，Standard降至3%。RASP仍非零但已入collapse zone，与D005 35% 完全collapse一致。DeepSeek-R1-Distill模型的\"可恢复稀疏度\"上界：~25%有效\n    操作范围，30%边界，35%+崩溃。不进行recovery：8% post-prune的reward signal 极稀疏，GRPO难以收敛。Distilled模型的冗余预算天然小于natively-trained模型，\n    因为distillation已经压缩了表示。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Sparsity Collapse Map\n    columns:\n    - Sparsity\n    - Method\n    - Post-Prune (%)\n    - Status\n    rows:\n    - - 20%\n      - RASP\n      - 31\n      - Recoverable\n    - - 20%\n      - Standard\n      - 27\n      - Partial\n    - - 25%\n      - RASP\n      - 20\n      - Recoverable\n    - - 25%\n      - Standard\n      - 12\n      - Weak\n    - - 30%\n      - RASP\n      - 8\n      - Near-collapse\n    - - 30%\n      - Standard\n      - 3\n      - Collapsed\n    - - 35%\n      - Both\n      - 0\n      - Collapsed (D005)\n  figures_description:\n  - Sparsity曲线20-35%，标注recoverable zone。\n  analysis: '完成RASP操作包络映射。Appendix/Discussion材料，回应\"为什么选20%\"。\n\n    '\n- name: OOD Evaluation (MATH-500, HumanEval)\n  plan_id: plan_012\n  description: Recovered models在GSM8K之外benchmark评估，验证RASP优势的OOD泛化。\n  expected_results:\n    baseline_math500: 0.7\n    rasp_recovered_math500: 0.55\n    standard_recovered_math500: 0.42\n    rasp_math500_advantage_pp: 13\n    baseline_humaneval: 0.5\n    rasp_recovered_humaneval: 0.4\n    standard_recovered_humaneval: 0.33\n    rasp_humaneval_advantage_pp: 7\n    rasp_mean_ood_retention: 0.793\n    standard_mean_ood_retention: 0.63\n  result_rationale: 'MATH-500上RASP优势13pp（55% vs 42%），HumanEval上7pp（40% vs 33%）。 MATH-500优势更大因为MATH需要更深推理链（多步数学推导），RASP保留的functionally\n    unique结构在深层推理中价值更高。HumanEval更依赖pattern matching/syntax knowledge，pruning影响相对较小。RASP\n    retention: GSM8K 84%, MATH-500 79%, HumanEval 80%——一致~80%+ retention说明RASP保留的是通用推理scaffold而非\n    GSM8K-specific patterns。Standard retention: GSM8K 64%, MATH-500 60%, HumanEval\n    66%——也一致但低~20pp。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Cross-Benchmark OOD Evaluation\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark\n    - Baseline (%)\n    - RASP (%)\n    - Standard (%)\n    - RASP Adv. (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 83.2\n      - 70\n      - 53\n      - 17\n    - - MATH-500\n      - 70\n      - 55\n      - 42\n      - 13\n    - - HumanEval\n      - 50\n      - 40\n      - 33\n      - 7\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Radar chart: baseline vs RASP vs Standard，3 benchmarks。'\n  analysis: 'OOD泛化将paper从GSM8K-specific提升为general reasoning compression method。 7-17pp一致优势回应reviewer的generalization\n    concern。\n\n    '\n- name: Bonsai Baseline at 20% Sparsity\n  plan_id: plan_013\n  description: Bonsai（ICML 2025）gradient-free结构化剪枝。补充external baseline。\n  expected_results:\n    bonsai_post_prune: 0.24\n    bonsai_post_sft: 0.5\n    bonsai_post_grpo: 0.47\n    bonsai_grpo_gain_pp: -3\n    bonsai_recovery_rate: 0.565\n  result_rationale: 'Bonsai activation-based importance，post-prune 24%略低于Standard\n    27%（Taylor importance在此模型上稍优，gradient signal捕获了更多推理相关信息）。GRPO对 Bonsai也产生负效应（-3pp），与Standard\n    pattern一致：importance-without-CKA 方法保留高重叠结构，缺乏GRPO所需的功能独特锚点。4种non-CKA方法中仅GRASPrune\n    从GRPO微弱获益（+3pp，因其gates隐式捕获了部分冗余信息），Standard(-11pp)和 Bonsai(-3pp)均受损。GRPO benefit不是普遍现象，而需要CKA-aware结构组成。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Extended Baselines\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Post-Prune (%)\n    - Post-GRPO (%)\n    - GRPO Δ (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - RASP\n      - 31\n      - 70\n      - 13\n    - - Standard\n      - 27\n      - 53\n      - -11\n    - - Bonsai\n      - 24\n      - 47\n      - -3\n    - - GRASPrune\n      - 10\n      - 38\n      - 3\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Bonsai补全baseline方阵。GRPO benefit pattern: RASP(+13) >> GRASPrune(+3) >\n    Bonsai(-3) > Standard(-11)。CKA-awareness是关键区分因素。\n\n    '\n- name: CKA Reliability Analysis\n  plan_id: plan_014\n  description: Split-half consistency和calibration size sensitivity，CKA scoring可靠性验证。\n  expected_results:\n    split_half_rho: 0.93\n    split_half_p: <0.0001\n    cal_256_gsm8k: 0.29\n    cal_512_gsm8k: 0.31\n    cal_1024_gsm8k: 0.32\n    cal_256_vs_512_rank_corr: 0.9\n    cal_512_vs_1024_rank_corr: 0.97\n    pruned_overlap_256_512: 0.86\n    pruned_overlap_512_1024: 0.95\n  result_rationale: 'Split-half ρ=0.93，linear CKA在512样本上已收敛。Calibration size影响微小：\n    256→512提升2pp(29→31%)，512→1024仅1pp(31→32%)，总range 3pp小于inter-seed variance。512是near-optimal\n    calibration size。核心剪枝决策（pruned set overlap 86-95%）对calibration不敏感。Housekeeping\n    but essential for credibility。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: CKA Reliability\n    columns:\n    - Analysis\n    - Metric\n    - Value\n    rows:\n    - - Split-half\n      - Spearman ρ\n      - 0.93\n    - - Cal 256\n      - GSM8K (%)\n      - 29\n    - - Cal 512\n      - GSM8K (%)\n      - 31\n    - - Cal 1024\n      - GSM8K (%)\n      - 32\n  figures_description:\n  - 左：split-half scatter。右：calibration sensitivity曲线，plateau at 512。\n  analysis: 'Appendix材料，main text一行引用。\n\n    '\n- name: α Sensitivity Ablation\n  plan_id: plan_015\n  description: α ∈ {0, 0.25, 0.5, 1.0, 2.0}，RASP唯一自由参数的系统性分析。\n  expected_results:\n    alpha_0_0: 0.25\n    alpha_0_25: 0.27\n    alpha_0_5: 0.29\n    alpha_1_0: 0.31\n    alpha_2_0: 0.35\n    optimal_alpha: 2.0\n    optimal_vs_alpha0_gap_pp: 10\n    curve_shape: monotonically increasing, diminishing returns\n  result_rationale: 'α=0（importance-only within RASP framework）给出25%，低于Standard 27%。原因：\n    RASP使用reasoning-trace calibration（CoT traces）计算importance，CoT traces 较长噪声较高，产生比standard\n    perplexity-calibration稍差的importance estimates。 CKA组件补偿并超过差距：α=0.5已达29%（超Standard\n    27%），α=2.0达35%。 曲线单调递增+diminishing returns：0→0.5增4pp，0.5→1.0增2pp，1.0→2.0增4pp （高α端acceleration提示optimal可能>2.0，与预实验α=4.0=40%一致）。\n    最优vs α=0 gap=10pp量化了CKA作为pruning signal的价值。α是唯一free parameter， 此ablation为practitioners提供调参指导：α=1合理default，α∈[1,2]推荐范围。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: α Ablation\n    columns:\n    - α\n    - Emphasis\n    - GSM8K (%)\n    - Δ vs α=0 (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - 0.0\n      - Importance-only\n      - 25\n      - 0\n    - - 0.25\n      - Weak CKA\n      - 27\n      - 2\n    - - 0.5\n      - Moderate CKA\n      - 29\n      - 4\n    - - 1.0\n      - Balanced (default)\n      - 31\n      - 6\n    - - 2.0\n      - Strong CKA\n      - 35\n      - 10\n  figures_description:\n  - α vs accuracy曲线，标注Standard(27%)reference line。α>0.3后RASP超Standard。\n  analysis: 'Dream reviewers全档位Critical实验。10pp gap量化CKA贡献。曲线未见peak说明 optimal α可能>2.0，motivates\n    future auto-tuning。\n\n    '\n- name: Inference Speedup Benchmark\n  plan_id: plan_016\n  description: Wall-clock latency + throughput比较。结构化剪枝的practical motivation。\n  expected_results:\n    dense_latency_ms: 12.4\n    rasp_20_latency_ms: 9.7\n    standard_20_latency_ms: 9.6\n    rasp_20_speedup: 1.28\n    dense_throughput_tok_s: 80.6\n    rasp_20_throughput_tok_s: 103.1\n    memory_reduction_pct: 18.5\n    unstructured_20_speedup: 1.02\n  result_rationale: '20%结构化稀疏度提供1.28x实际加速（12.4→9.7 ms/tok），因为移除200个MLP channel groups直接减少矩阵维度，不需sparse\n    hardware。RASP和Standard speedup 几乎相同（均~1.28x），因为两者移除相同数量structures。Memory减少18.5%。\n    对比unstructured 20%（仅1.02x，需sparse tensor cores），structured pruning 的practical\n    value明确。RASP在accuracy(70%) + speed(1.28x)两个维度均优于 unstructured(60%, 1.02x)。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Inference Benchmark\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Latency (ms/tok)\n    - Speedup\n    - Throughput (tok/s)\n    rows:\n    - - Dense\n      - 12.4\n      - 1.00x\n      - 80.6\n    - - RASP 20%\n      - 9.7\n      - 1.28x\n      - 103.1\n    - - Unstructured 20%\n      - 12.2\n      - 1.02x\n      - 82.0\n  figures_description:\n  - 双轴图：latency bars + throughput line。标注structured vs unstructured差异。\n  analysis: '1.28x加速 + 70% accuracy提供明确practical motivation。Structured RASP在 accuracy和speed两个维度均胜unstructured。\n\n    '\n- name: Unstructured Pruning Baseline at 20%\n  plan_id: plan_017\n  description: Magnitude-based unstructured 20%。标定structured vs unstructured gap，对标Self-Healing。\n  expected_results:\n    unstructured_post_prune: 0.45\n    unstructured_post_sft: 0.55\n    unstructured_post_grpo: 0.6\n    unstructured_grpo_gain_pp: 5\n    unstructured_recovery_rate: 0.721\n    unstructured_speedup: 1.02\n  result_rationale: 'Unstructured 20% post-prune 45%远高于structured RASP 31%——保留了所有architectural\n    structures，仅均匀削弱每个structure的capacity。但post-GRPO仅60%，低于RASP 70%。 看似反直觉：起点更高却恢复更低。原因：unstructured均匀削弱所有structures，\n    GRPO的redistribution机制在此设置下效率低——没有完整结构可以\"接管\"被削弱结构 的功能。RASP的结构化移除创造了明确的donor(移除的高重叠groups)和receiver\n    (保留的独特groups)，GRPO可清晰地将donor功能重分配给receiver。 关键比较：RASP structured(70%, 1.28x) vs\n    unstructured(60%, 1.02x)——accuracy 和speed双维度RASP占优。对标Self-Healing(2025)的unstructured设置。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Structured vs Unstructured\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Post-Prune (%)\n    - Post-GRPO (%)\n    - Speedup\n    rows:\n    - - RASP (structured)\n      - 31\n      - 70\n      - 1.28x\n    - - Standard (structured)\n      - 27\n      - 53\n      - 1.29x\n    - - Unstructured 20%\n      - 45\n      - 60\n      - 1.02x\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Scatter: accuracy vs speedup。RASP右上(高accuracy+高speed)，unstructured左下。'\n  analysis: 'RASP structured在accuracy(70>60)和speed(1.28>1.02)双维度优于unstructured。 完成\"为什么structured\n    pruning\"论证。\n\n    '\n- name: SFT OOD Eval Contingency\n  plan_id: plan_018\n  description: SFT-recovered模型的OOD评估。检验Standard SFT 64%的GSM8K-specificity。\n  expected_results:\n    standard_sft_math500: 0.35\n    standard_sft_humaneval: 0.25\n    rasp_sft_math500: 0.42\n    rasp_sft_humaneval: 0.32\n    standard_gsm8k_to_math500_retention: 0.538\n    rasp_gsm8k_to_math500_retention: 0.724\n  result_rationale: 'Best tier下GRPO advantage=17pp远超5pp阈值（contingency不strictly needed），\n    但仍提供有价值分析。Standard SFT从GSM8K 66%降至MATH-500 35%（retention 53%）， RASP SFT从58%降至42%（retention\n    72%）。Standard的OOD drop更剧烈：其SFT recovery包含显著GSM8K-specific pattern learning——SFT在高重叠结构上学到了\n    GSM8K特定的数字操作模板，不泛化到MATH。RASP的SFT recovery虽GSM8K绝对数低， 但泛化性好，因为functionally unique结构支持更通用推理。\n    补充Claim 3：SFT下Standard的优势是shallow(GSM8K-specific)，GRPO下RASP的 优势是deep(OOD-generalizable)。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: SFT OOD Transfer\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - GSM8K (%)\n    - MATH-500 (%)\n    - HumanEval (%)\n    - MATH Ret. (%)\n    rows:\n    - - RASP SFT-only\n      - 58\n      - 42\n      - 32\n      - 72.4\n    - - Standard SFT-only\n      - 66\n      - 35\n      - 25\n      - 53.8\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: GSM8K vs MATH-500 vs HumanEval。Standard GSM8K领先但OOD落后。'\n  analysis: Standard SFT优势是shallow，RASP GRPO优势是deep。Discussion增加\"surface vs genuine\n    reasoning recovery\"分析维度。\n","numLines":1011,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1011}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01MP2kDWLr4pWYhcfoLuaFd1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I've now read both the PDF paper and the review context YAML. Let me organize my understanding before dispatching two reviewers.\n\nThe paper introduces RASP (Recovery-Aware Structured Pruning), which uses CKA-based functional overlap to guide pruning decisions for reasoning LLMs, optimizing for RLVR recovery rather than immediate post-prune accuracy.\n\nKey claims:\n1. CKA-aware pruning produces 84.1% recovery vs 63.7% for standard (17pp gap)\n2. Per-structure CKA overlap is the strongest predictor of recoverability (β=0.38, partial R²=0.22)\n\n\n3. There's a significant 25pp pruning×recovery interaction (p=0.0008) showing ranking reversals between SFT and GRPO approaches\n\nNow I'm cross-referencing the paper against the 18 imagined experiments in the review context to see which ones are actually present. Looking through the tables and results, I can see coverage for the GSM8K experiments with both SFT warmup and GRPO recovery conditions, though I need to verify the full scope of what's included versus what's missing. I'm verifying that all 18 experimental plans are accounted for across the paper's tables and sections. Now I need to set up the review process by dispatching two reviewers in parallel—one to evaluate the methods and experiments, the other to assess novelty and related work—then move into the roundtable discussion.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":39766,"cache_read_input_tokens":22953,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":39766},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f3e56fa7-bcae-41e7-8b96-7c90222ffe81","uuid":"dfdb2091-dc4