{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01G4o1Jfmrfq1BASNue1rab6","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_17/projects/recovery_aware_struct_prune/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# recovery_aware_struct_prune — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-15 14:50 UTC | 更新原因: D032 GRPO v8 双卡稳定运行，更新工程历史和任务状态\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nRecovery-Aware Structured Pruning (RASP)：CKA functional overlap 指导结构化剪枝，在 matched sparsity 下比 importance-only 剪枝显著更好地保留推理能力（**Redundancy Paradox**）。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 目标会议\\\\nEMNLP 2026 ARR May 25 提交（距今 10 天）\\\\n\\\\n## 当前阶段\\\\n**Research Phase** — GRPO v8 双卡稳定运行中（D032）。westd GraSP SFT + α ablation 并行推进。\\\\n\\\\n## 核心证据（D027 修正后）\\\\n- ~~Post-prune: RASP 29% vs Standard 1%~~ → **D027 修正: RASP 31% vs Standard 27% (4pp, p=0.54, 不显著)**\\\\n- Post-SFT GSM8K (N=100): RASP 57% vs Standard 64%（Standard 反超 7pp）\\\\n- GraSP post-prune: 8% — RASP >> GraSP 3.6x，gradient-based baseline 远劣（D027 仍成立）\\\\n- α ablation post-prune: α=0.0 30% / α=0.5 25% / α=1.0 27% / α=4.0 40%（CI 重叠，N=100 不足以区分）\\\\n- α=4.0 post-SFT: 62%，α=1.0 post-SFT: 57%——SFT 有均衡化效应\\\\n- **GRPO v8 是唯一尚存的核心假设验证路径**\\\\n\\\\n## Claims & 实验覆盖\\\\n| Claim | P0 实验 | 状态 |\\\\n|-------|---------|------|\\\\n| C1: CKA-aware pruning preserves reasoning | plan_001-006, plan_015 | ⏳ GRPO v8 运行中 |\\\\n| C2: F(h) predicts recoverability | plan_007-008, plan_014-015 | 待 GRPO 完成 |\\\\n| C3: Recovery method conditions pruning order | plan_009 | SFT: Standard>RASP (D029)；待 GRPO 确认反转 |\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] **GRPO v8 双卡运行中** — westb cuda:0 RASP, cuda:1 Standard (~21h, ETA ~5/16 11:30 UTC)\\\\n- [ ] **GRPO v8 监控** — step 5 (~1h) 和 step 20 (~4h) 检查 reward/grad_norm 早期信号\\\\n- [ ] **GraSP SFT + eval** — westd cuda:0，接近完成\\\\n- [ ] **α ablation SFT sweep** — westd cuda:1, 已完成 α=0.0/0.5/1.0/4.0, α=2.0 启动中\\\\n- [ ] GRPO v8 完成 → eval 两模型(N=100, greedy) → 判定: |RASP-Standard| >15pp/5-15pp/<5pp\\\\n- [ ] 全部 α SFT+eval 完成 → α vs recovery 曲线\\\\n- [ ] [Dream P0] α ablation plan_015 — GRPO 完成后立即执行\\\\n- [ ] [Dream P1] Inference speedup plan_016 / Unstructured baseline plan_017\\\\n- [ ] [Dream] Multi-seed 扩展 plan_006 到 5 seeds\\\\n- [x] D027 definitive re-eval: RASP 31% vs Standard 27%\\\\n- [x] D028 kill v5 → start v6 (512→1024 fix truncation)\\\\n- [x] D029 SFT recovery: Standard 64% > RASP 57%\\\\n- [x] GraSP post-prune: 8%\\\\n- [x] D032 GRPO v8 启动（v6 OOM → v7 磁盘满 → v8 修复缓存+GPU映射+参数）\\\\n\\\\n## GRPO 结果 Contingency\\\\n| GRPO 结果 | 影响 | 行动 |\\\\n|-----------|------|------|\\\\n| RASP >> Standard (>15pp) | Recovery-pathway hypothesis 成立 | 全面推进 plan_001-017，story: CKA-guided pruning 创造更好 RL recovery dynamics |\\\\n| RASP > Standard (5-15pp) | Claim 1 成立但需加固 | 优先 plan_001 full eval + plan_006 multi-seed + plan_015 α ablation |\\\\n| RASP ≈ Standard (<5pp) | 核心假设失败 | 根本性 pivot: 转 training dynamics 分析 / 25% sparsity / 负向发现论文 |\\\\n| Standard > RASP | 全面失败 | Reframe 或终止 |\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- **westb-23072**: 2× ~98GB GPU | cuda:0 GRPO RASP v8, cuda:1 GRPO Standard v8\\\\n- **westd-11672**: 2× ~95GB GPU | cuda:0 GraSP SFT+eval, cuda:1 α ablation SFT sweep\\\\n- 约束 C001: 仅允许 westb cuda:0/1, westd cuda:0/1\\\\n- 总预算 ~480 GPU-hours (10 days × 2 server × 2 GPU × 24h)\\\\n\\\\n## GRPO 工程问题历史（v1-v8）\\\\nv1-v4: 截断/collapse/ETA过长 → v5: step 80 collapse → v6: OOM step 8 → v7: 磁盘满+参数错误+重复进程 → **v8: 缓存迁移+GPU映射+参数统一，双卡稳定运行**\\\\n\\\\n## 论文写作备忘（Dream 通用建议，给 Paper Agent）\\\\n- 扩展 references 到 25+，引用 FANG、FuncNet、RestoreLCC、PAT\\\\n- 论证 CKA vs SVCCA/CCA/MI 选择\\\\n- 讨论 Claim 2 潜在循环性并加以区分\\\\n- 报告 I(h)-F(h) correlation\\\\n- Temper scope claims（单模型局限性坦诚讨论）\\\\n\\\\n## 关键风险\\\\n1. **GRPO v8 失败 = 项目需根本性 pivot**——唯一核心风险\\\\n2. Post-prune 差异仅 4pp (p=0.54)——pre-recovery claim 已不成立，论文 story 完全依赖 GRPO recovery 阶段差异\\\\n3. 单模型限制 → Dream 三档一致标记\\\\n4. DDL 10 天——GRPO 结果 5/16 出，留 ~9 天写作+补实验\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D032 | 2026-05-15 | GRPO v7 双组崩溃(磁盘满+静默死亡)，v8 修复: HF cache 迁移数据盘 + GPU | grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v7, grpo_stage2_standard_20_v7 |\\\\n| D031 | 2026-05-15 | GRPO v6 OOM at step 8, 切 v7: 8-bit AdamW optimizer | grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v6, grpo_stage2_standard_20_v6 |\\\\n| D030 | 2026-05-15 | GRPO v6 双卡 OOM 崩溃(step 8)，切 v7: 8-bit optimizer +  | grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v6, grpo_stage2_standard_20_v6 |\\\\n| D029 | 2026-05-15 | SFT recovery 阶段 Standard 优于 RASP/α=4.0，核心假设在 SFT 层 | sft_alpha4_0_westd, sft_standard_20_retrain, grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v6, grpo_stage2_standard_20_v6 |\\\\n| D028 | 2026-05-15 | Kill GRPO v5 (RASP+Standard)，切 v6: max_completion_ | grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v5, grpo_stage2_standard_20_v5 |\\\\n| D027 | 2026-05-15 | Post-prune 核心 claim 崩塌（RASP 31% vs Standard 27%, p | reeval_postprune_definitive, grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v5 |\\\\n| D026 | 2026-05-15 | 将 RASP definitive re-eval 部署到 westd GPU 0 并行执行，不等  | reeval_postprune_definitive |\\\\n| D025 | 2026-05-15 | 挂起 D006/D014 基于 \\\\\\\"29x advantage\\\\\\\" 的所有结论，等待 definitiv | D023, D006, D014 |\\\\n| D024 | 2026-05-15 | CRITICAL: D023 re-eval 显示 Standard post-prune ~32% | D023, alpha_ablation_phase_a |\\\\n| D023 | 2026-05-15 | α ablation Phase A 暴露 importance formula confound  | alpha_ablation_phase_a |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 4626, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01KPGaLigezaM1dn9yTMSGyY","session_id":"f3e56fa7-bcae-41e7-8b96-7c90222ffe81","uuid":"77e4e6ca-4b3e-4a2b-849d-4cfb8d71fd93","timestamp":"2026-05-15T14:52:30.308Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01CQPeFdcE3ipTzmpjgeQEci","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0185a7Su4JdFuDptoPne6SMT","name":"mcp__agent-ml-research__read_project_file","input":{"project":"recovery_aware_struct_prune","file":"memory.md","max_chars":0},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7719,"cache_read_input_tokens":17678,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":7719,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":55,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01KPGaLigezaM1dn9yTMSGyY","session_id":"f3e56fa7-bcae-41e7-8b96-7c90222ffe81","uuid":"a9a04b99-f9c3-42e1-aca7-6340097c66eb"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0185a7Su4JdFuDptoPne6SMT","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_17/projects/recovery_aware_struct_prune/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Memory\\\\n\\\\n## 2026-05-15: D022 — Calibration sensitivity at 20% sparsity (fragile threshold)\\\\n- [关键发现] westb (512 calibration samples) 和 westd (256 samples) 代码完全一致（0 行 diff），但 α=0.0 结果分别为 1% 和 30%。根因：calibration sample 数量差异导致 ~5% MLP group 选择不同。模型在 20% sparsity 处于 fragile threshold，少量 group 变化引起巨大 accuracy 差异。\\\\n- [验证] westb Standard 1% 是真实退化（输出 \\\\\\\"10 years, 10 years...\\\\\\\" 重复循环 316KB），不是 eval bug。同服务器、同脚本、间隔 45 分钟，RASP 输出连贯推理（91KB）。\\\\n- [α ablation N=100] α=0.0 (30%) / α=0.5 (25%) / α=1.0 (27%) — 95% CI 重叠，无统计显著差异。需要 N=1319 全集才能下结论。\\\\n- [行动项] westd 需用 n_samples=512 重算 importance scores 消除 calibration 混淆。\\\\n\\\\n## 2026-05-15: GRPO sampling collapse on pruned models\\\\n- [失败模式] SFT 恢复 greedy 准确率 (57-64%) 和 EOS (99%) 后，GRPO sampling (temp=0.7) 仍导致剪枝模型退化为重复循环，grad_norm=0, reward=0。根因：剪枝模型在 stochastic sampling 下脆弱。\\\\n- [v2 失败] beta=0 + max_completion_length=1024, 双组 step 30-35 collapse → GRPO method failure。\\\\n- [v3 失败] beta=0.01 触发 GRPOTrainer from_pretrained 加载 ref_model，剪枝模型 shape mismatch 崩溃。\\\\n- [v4 修复] monkey-patch create_model_from_path → load_pruned_model。temp 0.7→0.4, repetition_penalty=1.15, format_reward +0.1, gradient_checkpointing=True, max_completion_length=2048。TRL 1.1.0。\\\\n- [经验] GRPO 在剪枝模型上必须预检 sampling 生成质量。beta>0 需要手动处理 ref_model 加载。\\\\n\\\\n## 2026-05-15: GraSP vs RASP — gradient saliency 远劣于 CKA-aware pruning\\\\n- [关键发现] GraSP 20% post-prune accuracy = 8% (50 样本 checkpoint)，RASP 20% = 29-31%，3.6x 差距。\\\\n- GraSP 模型 EOS rate 仅 2%（几乎所有输出截断在 4096 token），说明 gradient-based saliency 在结构化剪枝中严重破坏生成能力。\\\\n- 使用 GRASPrune 库，keep_ratio=0.80, rescale_alpha=0.5, 512 samples, 4 epochs gate training。\\\\n- 模型路径: `/root/autodl-tmp/recovery_aware_struct_prune/pruned_graspune_20/`\\\\n- [意义] 有力回应 Dream reviewer concern (plan_005)——RASP 显著优于主流 gradient-based baseline。\\\\n\\\\n## 2026-05-15: α ablation SFT — 非单调关系确认\\\\n- α=4.0: post-prune 40% → post-SFT 62% (+22pp)，为所有 α 值中最高\\\\n- α=1.0 (RASP default): post-prune 29% → post-SFT 57%\\\\n- Standard: post-prune 27% → post-SFT 64%\\\\n- [观察] post-prune 阶段 α=4.0 最优，但 post-SFT 阶段差距缩小（57-64% 范围）。SFT 有均衡化效应。\\\\n- [关键问题] GRPO 阶段是否能拉开差距？这是整个论文 narrative 的决定性验证。\\\\n\\\\n## 2026-05-15: sft_standard_20 checkpoint 已删除\\\\n- 磁盘清理删除了 sft_standard_20（81GB），正在 cuda:1 重训。\\\\n- 重训参数：pruned_standard_20 + GSM8K full train (7473) + 2 epochs + lr=2e-5，~37-40 min。\\\\n\\\\n## 2026-05-15: 代码与环境备忘\\\\n- α ablation: `prune.py` 支持 `--alpha`，CKA 分数缓存 `results/cka_scores.pt`\\\\n- Full eval: `scripts/run_full_eval.sh`（新版），`src/run_full_eval.sh`（旧版）\\\\n- GRASPrune: `/root/GRASPrune/`，不要 `pip install -r requirements.txt`\\\\n- GRPO 输出路径：`grpo_stage2_rasp_20` / `grpo_stage2_standard_20`\\\\n- sft_recovery.py 不支持 `--save_strategy` 和 `--overwrite_output_dir` 参数\\\\n- westb 磁盘：数据盘 250GB 已用 141GB，剩 110GB\\\\n- westd 磁盘：释放 93GB 后空间充足（原 72GB used → 大幅改善）\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2685, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01KPGaLigezaM1dn9yTMSGyY","session_id":"f3e56fa7-bcae-41e7-8b96-7c90222ffe81","uuid":"b393f62d-b76a-4265-831d-b7ea6923d24a","timestamp":"2026-05-15T14:52:33.632Z"}
