{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012V5eagczYaTB8nkdRiY5kk","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_17/projects/recovery_aware_struct_prune/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-15\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\\\n| grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v8 | D031: GRPO v8 RASP — v7 disk crash fix. HF cache redirected to data disk. 8-bit AdamW, max_completion_length=1024, beta=0.01, temp=0.4, rep_penalty=1.15, format_reward=0.1, gradient_checkpointing=True, 100 steps. Parent: sft_rasp_20. | — | — | [0wz7xpd5] |\\\\n| grpo_stage2_standard_20_v8 | D031: GRPO v8 Standard (negative control) — v7 disk crash fix + GPU mapping fix. HF cache redirected to data disk, CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=1 + --gpu 0. 8-bit AdamW, max_completion_length=1024, identical params to RASP v8. Parent: sft_standard_20_retrain. | — | — | [q34vz8j2] |\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- eval-sft-alpha-1p0（准备中）\\\\n- sft_alpha2_0_westd: D027: α=2.0 pruned model SFT recovery on westd. α=2.0 post-prune accuracy 29%. Same SFT params as other α variants (2 epochs, lr=2e-5, batch=1, grad_accum=8). Completes α ablation sweep.（准备中）\\\\n- grasp_baseline_westd: D027: GraSP baseline on westd — compare GraSP pruning criterion against RASP at 20% sparsity. If RASP > GraSP post-recovery, confirms CKA-aware scoring advantage over gradient-based saliency. Critical for plan_005 and Dream reviewer concern.（准备中）\\\\n- sft_grasp_20_westd: D028: GraSP pruned model (8% post-prune) SFT recovery. Same params as RASP/Standard SFT (2 epochs, lr=2e-5, batch=1, grad_accum=8). Completes three-way comparison: Standard 27%→64%, RASP 31%→57%, GraSP 8%→?. Tests whether importance metric choice affects recovery potential.（准备中）\\\\n- grpo_stage2_standard_20_v5: D027: GRPO v5 Standard (negative control) — identical params to RASP GRPO v5: beta=0.01, temp=0.4, rep_penalty=1.15, format_reward=0.1, max_completion_length=512, gradient_checkpointing=True, monkey-patch ref_model. Direct comparison with grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v5. If RASP >> Standard, confirms CKA-aware pruning preserves RLVR-recoverable structures.（准备中）\\\\n- alpha_ablation_westd_cal256: α ablation sweep (calibration=256, N=100). α∈{0.0,0.5,1.0,2.0,4.0} at 20% sparsity. Phase A (prune+eval) complete, Phase B (SFT) in progress. Note: calibration=256 differs from westb original (512), causing ~5% group selection differences.（准备中）\\\\n- mvp_rasp_pipeline_v4: CKA functional overlap F(h) predicts structured pruning recoverability under RLVR. RASP scoring S(h)=I(h)×(1-F(h))^α selects structures whose removal is more recoverable via GRPO RLVR than standard importance-only pruning. V4: Dual sparsity probe (20% + 25%) to find viable operating point where pruned models retain >5% accuracy, then GRPO recovery comparison.（准备中）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **eval-sft-alpha-0p0** (success): —\\\\n- **grpo_stage2_standard_20_v7** (failed): D030: GRPO v7 — v6 OOM fix. 8-bit AdamW optimizer (bitsandbytes) saves ~50% optimizer memory. max_steps=100 (~756s/step). All other params same as v6: max_completion_length=1024, beta=0.01, temp=0.4, rep_penalty=1.15, format_reward=0.1, gradient_checkpointing=True, monkey-patch ref_model. ← 基于 sft_standard_20_retrain\\\\n- **grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v7** (failed): D030: GRPO v7 — v6 OOM fix. 8-bit AdamW optimizer (bitsandbytes) saves ~50% optimizer memory. max_steps=100 (~756s/step). All other params same as v6: max_completion_length=1024, beta=0.01, temp=0.4, rep_penalty=1.15, format_reward=0.1, gradient_checkpointing=True, monkey-patch ref_model. ← 基于 sft_rasp_20\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 7 / 负向 5 / 失败 10 / 共 28\\\\ntrain_loss_final: 0.64 →（近 3 次 success）\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestb-23072: 无 GPU 信息\\\\nwestd-11672: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- mvp_rasp_pipeline: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_rasp_pipeline_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_rasp_20: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_standard_20: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_rasp_20_4096: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_stage2_rasp_20: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_stage2_standard_20: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_stage2_standard_20_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v3: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v4: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v5: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- sft_alpha4_0_westd: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v6: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_stage2_standard_20_v6: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v7: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_stage2_standard_20_v7: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 4164, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01XRksUD5v4kDZQfKPL7aJke","session_id":"f3e56fa7-bcae-41e7-8b96-7c90222ffe81","uuid":"3b26738e-b70f-426b-94e2-00fa83d9a6be","timestamp":"2026-05-15T14:53:00.775Z"}
